msgstr "一阶 MCSCF："

msgid ""
"All publications resulting from use of this program must acknowledge the "
"above. See also:"
msgstr "所有使用本程序产生的出版物必须引用上述文献。另请参阅："

msgid ""
"This program allows one to perform CASSCF as well as general MCSCF "
"calculations. For CASSCF calculations, one can optionally use Slater "
"determinants or CSFs as a :math:`N`-electron basis. In most cases, the use "
"of Slater determinants is more efficient. General MCSCF calculations must "
"use CSFs as a basis."
msgstr ""
"本程序可用于执行 CASSCF 以及通用 MCSCF 计算。对于 CASSCF 计算，可以选择使用斯莱特行列式或 CSFs 作为 "
":math:`N`-电子基组。在大多数情况下，使用斯莱特行列式效率更高。通用 MCSCF 计算必须使用 CSFs 作为基组。"

msgid ""
"There are two different MCSCF methods implemented in MOLPRO: the first-order"
" and the second-order method (see `First-order MCSCF (for large molecules) "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#first-order-mcscf-for-large-molecules>`__ and "
"`Second-order MCSCF <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#second-order-mcscf>`__). "
"The latter one is second-order in the orbital and CI coefficient changes and"
" is therefore quadratically convergent. Since important higher order terms "
"in the independent orbital parameters are included, almost cubic convergence"
" is often observed. For simple cases, convergence is usually achieved in 3-4"
" iterations. However, the quadratic method requires the full orbital "
"Hessian, and therefore, the computation time and memory requirements grow "
"strongly with the molecular size. This problem is overcome by the first-"
"order MCSCF method, where some second derivatives of the orbital parameters "
"are approximated. The computation-time per iteration is considerably lower "
"than in the second-order method, but more iterations are required. The "
"overall convergence is improved by a convergence accelerator based on the "
"L-BFGS method."
msgstr ""
"MOLPRO 中实现了两种不同的 MCSCF 方法：一阶方法和二阶方法（参见 `一阶 MCSCF（适用于大分子） "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#first-order-mcscf-for-large-molecules>`__ 和 "
"`二阶 MCSCF <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#second-order-mcscf>`__\\ ）。后者在轨道和 CI"
" 系数的变化上是二阶的，因此是二次收敛的。由于包含了独立轨道参数中的重要高阶项，通常可以观察到接近三次的收敛速度。对于简单情况，通常经过 3-4 "
"次迭代即可达到收敛。然而，二次方法需要完整的轨道 Hessian 矩阵，因此计算时间和内存需求随分子尺寸急剧增长。一阶 MCSCF "
"方法克服了这个问题，它近似处理了轨道参数的一些二阶导数。每次迭代的计算时间显著低于二阶方法，但需要更多的迭代次数。整体收敛性通过基于 L-BFGS "
"方法的收敛加速器得到改善。"

msgid ""
"However, convergence problems can still occur in certain applications, and "
"usually indicate that the active space is not adequately chosen. For "
"instance, if two weakly occupied orbitals are of similar importance to the "
"energy, but only one of them is included in the active set, the program "
"might alternate between them. In such cases either reduction or enlargement "
"of the active orbital space can solve the problem. In other cases "
"difficulties can occur if two electronic states in the same symmetry are "
"almost or exactly degenerate, since then the program can switch from one "
"state to the other. This might happen near avoided crossings or near an "
"asymptote. Problems of this sort can be avoided by optimizing the energy "
"average of the particular states. It is also possible to force convergence "
"to specific states by choosing a subset of configurations as primary space "
"(``PSPACE``). The hamiltonian is constructed and diagonalized explicitly in "
"this space; the coefficients of the remaining configurations are optimized "
"iteratively using the P-space wavefunction as zeroth order approximation. "
"For linear molecules, another possibility is to use the ``LQUANT`` option, "
"which makes it possible to force convergence to states with definite "
":math:`\\Lambda` quantum number, i.e., :math:`\\Sigma`, :math:`\\Pi`, "
":math:`\\Delta`, etc. states."
msgstr ""
"然而，在某些应用中仍可能出现收敛问题，这通常表明活性空间选择不当。例如，如果两个弱占据轨道对能量的重要性相似，但其中只有一个被包含在活性集中，程序可能会在它们之间交替。在这种情况下，减小或扩大活性轨道空间可以解决问题。在其他情况下，如果同一对称性下的两个电子态几乎或完全简并，则可能出现困难，因为程序可能会从一个态切换到另一个态。这可能发生在避免交叉附近或渐近线附近。通过优化特定态的能量平均值可以避免此类问题。也可以通过选择一组构型作为主空间（\\"
" ``PSPACE``\\ ）来强制收敛到特定态。哈密顿量在此空间中显式构造并对角化；剩余构型的系数使用 P "
"空间波函数作为零阶近似进行迭代优化。对于线性分子，另一种可能性是使用 ``LQUANT`` 选项，这使得可以强制收敛到具有确定 "
":math:`\\Lambda` 量子数的态，即 :math:`\\Sigma`\\ 、\\ :math:`\\Pi`\\ 、\\ "
":math:`\\Delta` 等态。"

msgid "Structure of the input"
msgstr "输入结构"

msgid ""
"All sub-commands known to *MULTI* may be abbreviated by four letters. The "
"input commands fall into several logical groups; within each group commands "
"may appear in any order, but the groups must come in correct order."
msgstr ""
"*MULTI* 已知的所有子命令都可以用四个字母缩写。输入命令分为几个逻辑组；在每个组内，命令可以按任意顺序出现，但各组必须按正确的顺序排列。"

msgid "cards defining partitioning of orbitals spaces – ``OCC,FROZEN,CLOSED``"
msgstr "定义轨道空间划分的卡片 – ``OCC,FROZEN,CLOSED``"

msgid "general options (most commands not otherwise specified here)"
msgstr "通用选项（此处未另行指定的大多数命令）"

msgid "a ``WF`` card defining a state symmetry"
msgstr "定义态对称性的 ``WF`` 卡片"

msgid ""
"options pertaining to that state symmetry – ``WEIGHT,STATE,LQUANT`` (must be"
" given after ``WF``)"
msgstr "与该态对称性相关的选项 – ``WEIGHT,STATE,LQUANT``\\ （必须在 ``WF`` 之后给出）"

msgid ""
"configuration specification for that state symmetry – "
"``SELECT,CON,RESTRICT``"
msgstr "该态对称性的组态指定 – ``SELECT,CON,RESTRICT``"

msgid ""
"definition of the primary configurations for that state symmetry - "
"``PSPACE``"
msgstr "该态对称性的主组态定义 - ``PSPACE``"

msgid "further general options"
msgstr "进一步的通用选项"

msgid ""
"Stages d) through to h) may be repeated several times; this is the way in "
"which you specify an average energy of several states of different symmetry."
msgstr "步骤 d) 到 h) 可以重复多次；这是您指定多个不同对称性态的平均能量的方式。"

msgid ""
"If the command ``CASCI`` is given, only a CI calculation for each states is "
"carried out. This is the same as giving option ``CAS-CI``. Optionally, "
"natural or pseudo-canonical orbitals can be generated using the final CI "
"vectors. See option `CAS-CI <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cas-ci>`__ for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"如果给出命令 ``CASCI``\\ ，则仅对每个态执行 CI 计算。这与给出选项 ``CAS-CI`` 相同。可选地，可以使用最终的 CI "
"向量生成自然轨道或准正则轨道。更多详情请参见选项 `CAS-CI <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cas-ci>`__\\ "
"。"

msgid ""
"Many options, directives, and thresholds, which can also be given on the "
"command line, are described in section `options of the MCSCF program "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#options-of-the-mcscf-program>`__ and "
"`directives of the MCSCF program <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#directives-"
"of-the-mcscf-program>`__."
msgstr ""
"许多也可以在命令行上给出的选项、指令和阈值，在章节 `options of the MCSCF program "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#options-of-the-mcscf-program>`__ 和 `directives"
" of the MCSCF program <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#directives-of-the-mcscf-"
"program>`__ 中有描述。"

msgid "Defining the orbital subspaces"
msgstr "定义轨道子空间"

msgid "Occupied orbitals"
msgstr "占据轨道"

msgid ""
":math:`n_i` specifies numbers of occupied orbitals (including FROZEN and "
"CLOSED) in irreducible representation number :math:`i`. In the absence of an"
" ``OCC`` card, the information from the most recent MCSCF calculation is "
"used, or, if there is none, those orbitals corresponding to a minimal "
"valence set, i.e., full valence space, are used."
msgstr ""
":math:`n_i` 指定了不可约表示编号 :math:`i` 中的占据轨道（包括 FROZEN 和 CLOSED）数量。若未提供 ``OCC`` "
"卡片，则使用最近一次 MCSCF 计算的信息，或者，如果没有，则使用对应于最小价集（即全价空间）的那些轨道。"

msgid "Frozen-core orbitals"
msgstr "冻结芯轨道"

msgid ""
":math:`n_i` is the number of frozen-core orbitals in irrep number :math:`i`."
" These orbitals are doubly occupied in all configurations and not optimized."
" Note that in earlier Molpro versions this directive was called ``CORE`` and"
" has now been renamed to avoid confusion with ``CORE`` orbitals in the MRCI "
"and CCSD programs."
msgstr ""
":math:`n_i` 是不可约表示编号 :math:`i` 中的冻结芯轨道数量。这些轨道在所有组态中均为双占据且不被优化。请注意，在早期 Molpro"
" 版本中，此指令称为 ``CORE``\\ ，现已重命名以避免与 MRCI 和 CCSD 程序中的 ``CORE`` 轨道混淆。"

msgid ""
"*record.file* is the record name for frozen core orbitals; if not supplied, "
"taken from *orb* on ``START`` card. *record.file* can be specified in any "
"field after the last nonzero :math:`n_i`. It should always be given if the "
"orbital guess is from a neighbouring geometry and should then specify the "
"SCF orbitals calculated at the present geometry. If a subsequent gradient "
"calculation is performed with this wavefunction, *record.file* is mandatory "
"and must specify closed-shell SCF orbitals at the present geometry. Note "
"that *record* must be larger than 2000."
msgstr ""
"*record.file* 是冻结芯轨道的记录名；若未提供，则取自 ``START`` 卡片上的 *orb*\\ 。\\ *record.file* "
"可以在最后一个非零 :math:`n_i` 之后的任何字段中指定。如果轨道初猜来自邻近几何结构，则应始终给出此参数，并且它应指定在当前几何结构下计算的 "
"SCF 轨道。如果使用此波函数执行后续梯度计算，则 *record.file* 是必需的，并且必须指定在当前几何结构下的闭壳层 SCF "
"轨道。请注意，\\ *record* 必须大于 2000。"

msgid ""
"*type* optionally specified the orbital type, e.g., ALPHA, BETA, or NATURAL "
"if UHF/UKS orbitals are used."
msgstr "*type* 可选地指定轨道类型，例如，如果使用 UHF/UKS 轨道，则为 ALPHA、BETA 或 NATURAL。"

msgid ""
"If the ``FROZEN`` card is omitted, then the numbers of core orbitals are "
"taken from the most recent MCSCF calculation, or otherwise no orbitals are "
"frozen. If the ``FROZEN`` card is given as ``FROZEN``,record.file, then the "
"orbitals corresponding to atomic inner shells are taken, i.e., :math:`1s` "
"for Li–Ne, :math:`1s2s2p` for Na–Ar, etc. A ``FROZEN`` card without any "
"specification resets the number of frozen core orbitals to zero."
msgstr ""
"如果省略 ``FROZEN`` 卡片，则冻结芯轨道的数量取自最近的 MCSCF 计算，否则不冻结任何轨道。如果 ``FROZEN`` 卡片以 "
"``FROZEN``,record.file 的形式给出，则采用对应于原子内壳层的轨道，即 Li–Ne 的 :math:`1s`\\ ，Na–Ar 的 "
":math:`1s2s2p` 等。没有任何说明的 ``FROZEN`` 卡片会将冻结芯轨道的数量重置为零。"

msgid "Closed-shell orbitals"
msgstr "闭壳层轨道"

msgid ""
"If the ``CLOSED`` card is omitted, then the data defaults to that of the "
"most recent MCSCF calculation, or else the atomic inner shells as described "
"above for ``FROZEN``."
msgstr ""
"如果省略 ``CLOSED`` 卡片，则数据默认为最近一次 MCSCF 计算的数据，否则默认为上述 ``FROZEN`` 中描述的原子内壳层。"

msgid "Freezing orbitals"
msgstr "冻结轨道"

msgid ""
"The specified orbital will not be optimized and will remain identical to the"
" starting guess. *orb.sym* should be an active or closed-shell orbital. If "
"*orb.sym* is a frozen core orbital, this card has no effect."
msgstr ""
"指定的轨道将不会被优化，并保持与初始猜测相同。\\ *orb.sym* 应该是一个活性或闭壳层轨道。如果 *orb.sym* "
"是冻结芯轨道，则此卡片无效。"

msgid "Defining the optimized states"
msgstr "定义待优化的态"

msgid ""
"Each state symmetry to be optimized is specified by one WF card, which may "
"optionally be followed by ``STATE, WEIGHT, RESTRICT, SELECT, CON,`` and/or "
"``PSPACE`` cards. All cards belonging to a particular state symmetry as "
"defined on the ``WF`` card must form a block which comes directly after the "
"``WF`` card. The cards can be in any order, however."
msgstr ""
"每个待优化的态对称性由一个WF卡指定，其后可选择性跟随\\ ``STATE, WEIGHT, RESTRICT, SELECT, CON,`` 和/或 "
"``PSPACE`` 卡。所有属于\\ ``WF``\\ 卡定义的特定态对称性的卡必须形成一个块，该块紧接在\\ ``WF``\\ "
"卡之后。然而，这些卡可以按任意顺序排列。"

msgid "Defining the state symmetry"
msgstr "定义态对称性"

msgid ""
"The number of electrons and the total symmetry of the wavefunction are "
"specified on the WF card:"
msgstr "电子数和波函数的总对称性在WF卡上指定："

msgid "where"
msgstr "其中"

msgid ""
"Note that these values take sensible defaults if any or all are not "
"specified (see section `symmetry "
"<general_program_structure.html#symmetry>`__)."
msgstr ""
"请注意，如果这些值中的任何一个或全部未指定，它们会采用合理的默认值（参见 `symmetry "
"<general_program_structure.html#symmetry>`__ 节）。"

msgid ""
"The input directives ``STATE``, ``WEIGHT``, ``LQUANT``, ``SELECT``, "
"``PUNCSF`` always refer to the state symmetry as defined on the previous "
"``WF`` card. If such a directive is found before a ``WF`` card has been "
"given, an error occurs. If any of these cards and a ``WF`` card is given, "
"the variables ``STATE``, ``WEIGHT``, ``LQUANT``, ``SELECT`` are *not* used, "
"and the number of state symmetries defaults to one, regardless of how many "
"symmetries are specified in variable ``[MC]SYMMETRY``."
msgstr ""
"输入指令 ``STATE``\\ 、\\ ``WEIGHT``\\ 、\\ ``LQUANT``\\ 、\\ ``SELECT``\\ 、\\ "
"``PUNCSF`` 总是引用前一个 ``WF`` 卡片上定义的态对称性。如果在给出 ``WF`` "
"卡片之前找到此类指令，则会发生错误。如果给出这些卡片中的任何一张以及 ``WF`` 卡片，则变量 ``STATE``\\ 、\\ "
"``WEIGHT``\\ 、\\ ``LQUANT``\\ 、\\ ``SELECT`` *不* 被使用，并且态对称性的数量默认为一个，无论变量 "
"``[MC]SYMMETRY`` 中指定了多少个对称性。"

msgid "Defining the number of states in the present symmetry"
msgstr "定义当前对称性中的态数量"

msgid ""
"*nstate* is the number of states in the present symmetry. By default, all "
"states are optimized with weight 1 (see ``WEIGHT`` card). The ``STATE`` "
"directive must follow a ``WF`` card."
msgstr ""
"*nstate* 是当前对称性中的态数量。默认情况下，所有权重为 1 的所有态都会被优化（参见 ``WEIGHT`` 卡片）。\\ ``STATE`` "
"指令必须跟在 ``WF`` 卡片之后。"

msgid "Specifying weights in state-averaged calculations"
msgstr "在态平均计算中指定权重"

msgid ""
":math:`w(i)` is the weight for the state :math:`i` in the present symmetry. "
"By default, all weights are 1.0. See also ``STATE`` card. If you want to "
"optimize the second state of a particular state symmetry alone, specify"
msgstr ""
":math:`w(i)` 是当前对称性中态 :math:`i` 的权重。默认情况下，所有权重均为 1.0。另请参阅 ``STATE`` "
"卡片。如果您想单独优化特定态对称性的第二个态，请指定"

msgid "``STATE,2;WEIGHT,0,1;``"
msgstr "``STATE,2;WEIGHT,0,1;``"

msgid ""
"Note, however, that this might lead to root-flipping problems. ``WEIGHT`` "
"should follow a ``STATE`` directive."
msgstr "但请注意，这可能导致根翻转问题。\\ ``WEIGHT`` 应跟在 ``STATE`` 指令之后。"

msgid ""
"If very many states are included and weights are not 1, the following input "
"simplifications are possible:"
msgstr "如果包含非常多的态且权重不为 1，则可以使用以下输入简化方式："

msgid "``STATE,50;WEIGHT,ALL,3``"
msgstr "``STATE,50;WEIGHT,ALL,3``"

msgid ""
"This sets all weights in the current state symmetry to 3. One can also "
"specify ranges of weights, e.g.,"
msgstr "这将当前态对称性中的所有权重设置为 3。也可以指定权重范围，例如，"

msgid "``STATE,50;WEIGHT,20[3],30[1]``"
msgstr "``STATE,50;WEIGHT,20[3],30[1]``"

msgid ""
"which sets the weights for the first 20 states to 3 and the remaining ones "
"to 1. The total number of states given in this way must equal the number of "
"states."
msgstr "这将前 20 个态的权重设置为 3，其余态的权重设置为 1。以此方式给出的态总数必须等于态的数量。"

msgid "Dynamical weighting"
msgstr "动态加权"

msgid ""
"Dynamical weighting, as described in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1667468>`__ **120**, 7281 (2004), can be "
"activated using"
msgstr ""
"如 `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1667468>`__ **120**, 7281 "
"(2004) 中所述，动态加权可以通过以下方式激活"

msgid "The weights for each state are then computed as"
msgstr "随后每个态的权重计算如下"

msgid "w=1/\\cosh(dynfac*\\Delta E)^2"
msgstr ""
"w=1/\\cosh(dynfac*\\Delta E)^2\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"where :math:`\\Delta E` is the energy difference (in Hartree) between the "
"state under consideration and the state with the lowest energy. This is "
"dynamically adjusted during the optimization process."
msgstr "其中 :math:`\\Delta E` 是所考虑态与最低能量态之间的能量差（以 Hartree 为单位）。这在优化过程中会动态调整。"

msgid ""
"Optionally, it is possible to restrict the number of states which are "
"included in the dynamically weighting:"
msgstr "可选地，可以限制参与动态加权的态的数量："

msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "Defining the configuration space"
msgstr "定义组态空间"

msgid "Occupation restrictions"
msgstr "占据限制"

msgid ""
"This card can be used to restrict the occupation patterns. Only "
"configurations containing between *nmin* and *nmax* electrons in the "
"specified orbitals *orb*\\ :math:`_1`,  *orb*\\ :math:`_2`,\\ "
":math:`\\ldots`,\\ *orb*\\ :math:`_n` are included in the wavefunction. If "
"*nmin* and  *nmax* are negative, configurations with exactly abs(*nmin*) and"
" abs(*nmax*) electrons in the specified orbitals are deleted. This can be "
"used, for instance, to omit singly excited configurations. The orbitals are "
"specified in the form *number.sym*, where *number* is the number of the "
"orbital in irrep *sym*. Several ``RESTRICT`` cards may follow each other. "
"``RESTRICT`` only works if a CONFIG card is specified before the first "
"``WF`` card."
msgstr ""
"此卡片可用于限制占据模式。只有包含指定轨道 *orb*\\ :math:`_1`, *orb*\\ :math:`_2`,\\ "
":math:`\\ldots`,\\ *orb*\\ :math:`_n` 中电子数在 *nmin* 和 *nmax* "
"之间的组态才会被包含在波函数中。如果 *nmin* 和 *nmax* 为负数，则删除在指定轨道中恰好有 abs(*nmin*) 和 "
"abs(*nmax*) 个电子的组态。例如，这可用于省略单激发组态。轨道以 *number.sym* 的形式指定，其中 *number* "
"是轨道在不可约表示 *sym* 中的编号。多个 ``RESTRICT`` 卡片可以连续出现。\\ ``RESTRICT`` 仅在第一个 ``WF`` "
"卡片之前指定了 CONFIG 卡片时才有效。"

msgid ""
"``RESTRICT`` cards given before the first ``WF`` cards are global, i.e., are"
" active for all state symmetries. If such a global restrict card is given, "
"variable ``[MC]RESTRICT`` is *not* used."
msgstr ""
"在第一个 ``WF`` 卡片之前给出的 ``RESTRICT`` 卡片是全局的，即对所有态对称性都有效。如果给出了这样的全局限制卡片，则变量 "
"``[MC]RESTRICT`` *不*\\ 被使用。"

msgid ""
"Additional state-specific ``RESTRICT`` cards may be given after a ``WF`` "
"card. These are used in addition to the global orbital restrictions."
msgstr "可在 ``WF`` 卡片后给出额外的态特定 ``RESTRICT`` 卡片。这些卡片将叠加在全局轨道限制之上使用。"

msgid ""
"If neither state-specific nor global ``RESTRICT`` cards are found, the "
"values from the variable ``[MC]RESTRICT`` are used."
msgstr "如果既未找到态特定也未找到全局的 ``RESTRICT`` 卡片，则使用变量 ``[MC]RESTRICT`` 中的值。"

msgid "Selecting configurations"
msgstr "选择组态"

msgid ""
"This card is used to specify a configuration set other than a CAS, which is "
"the default. This option automatically triggers the ``CONFIG`` option, which"
" selects CSFs rather than determinants. Configurations can be defined using "
"``CON`` cards, which must follow immediately the SELECT card. Alternatively,"
" if *ref1* is an existing Molpro record name, the configurations are read in"
" from that record and may be selected according to a given threshold."
msgstr ""
"此卡片用于指定除默认的CAS之外的组态集。此选项会自动触发 ``CONFIG`` 选项，该选项选择CSF而非行列式。组态可以使用 ``CON`` "
"卡片定义，这些卡片必须紧跟在SELECT卡片之后。或者，如果 *ref1* "
"是一个现有的Molpro记录名称，则组态将从该记录中读入，并可根据给定的阈值进行选择。"

msgid "Specifying orbital configurations"
msgstr "指定轨道组态"

msgid "Example for the BH molecule:"
msgstr "以 BH 分子为例："

msgid "Selecting the primary configuration set"
msgstr "选择主组态集"

msgid ""
"The hamiltonian is constructed and diagonalized explicitly in the primary "
"configuration space, which can be selected with the ``PSPACE`` card. The "
"coefficients of the remaining configurations (Q-space) are optimized "
"iteratively using the P-space wavefunction as zeroth order approximation."
msgstr ""
"哈密顿量在主组态空间中显式构造并对角化，该空间可通过 ``PSPACE`` 卡片选择。剩余组态（Q 空间）的系数使用 P "
"空间波函数作为零级近似进行迭代优化。"

msgid ""
"If *thresh* is nonzero, it is a threshold for automatically selecting all "
"configurations as P-space configurations which have energies less then "
":math:`emin+thresh`, where *emin* is the lowest energy of all "
"configurations. Further P-space configurations can be specified using "
"``CON`` cards, which must follow immediately after the ``PSPACE`` card. "
"These are merged with the ones selected according to the threshold. "
"Automatic selection can be avoided by specifying a very small threshold. "
"There is a sensible default value for thresh (0.4), so you usually don’t "
"need a ``pspace`` card in your input. Furthermore, if the number of "
"configurations in the MCSCF is less than 20, all configurations go into the "
"P-space unless you give a PSPACE card in the input."
msgstr ""
"如果 *thresh* 非零，则它是一个阈值，用于自动选择所有能量低于 :math:`emin+thresh` 的组态作为 P 空间组态，其中 "
"*emin* 是所有组态中的最低能量。可以使用 ``CON`` 卡片指定更多的 P 空间组态，这些卡片必须紧跟在 ``PSPACE`` "
"卡片之后。它们将与根据阈值选择的组态合并。通过指定一个非常小的阈值可以避免自动选择。thresh "
"有一个合理的默认值（0.4），因此通常不需要在输入中使用 ``pspace`` 卡片。此外，如果 MCSCF 中的组态数量少于 20，除非在输入中给出 "
"PSPACE 卡片，否则所有组态都将进入 P 空间。"

msgid ""
"A P-space threshold defined on a ``PSPACE`` card before the first ``WF`` (or"
" ``STATE``, ``WEIGHT``, ``SELECT``, ``PUNCSF`` if ``WF`` is not given) card "
"is global, i.e., valid for all state symmetries. State-specific thresholds "
"can be defined by placing a ``PSPACE`` card after the corresponding ``WF`` "
"card. In the latter case the ``PSPACE`` card can be followed by ``CON`` "
"cards, which define state-specific P-space configurations."
msgstr ""
"在第一个 ``WF``\\ （或 ``STATE``\\ 、\\ ``WEIGHT``\\ 、\\ ``SELECT``\\ 、\\ "
"``PUNCSF``\\ ，如果未给出 ``WF``\\ ）卡片之前定义的 ``PSPACE`` 卡片上的 P "
"空间阈值是全局的，即对所有态对称性有效。可以通过在相应的 ``WF`` 卡片之后放置 ``PSPACE`` 卡片来定义态特定的阈值。在后一种情况下，\\"
" ``PSPACE`` 卡片后面可以跟有 ``CON`` 卡片，这些卡片定义了态特定的 P 空间组态。"

msgid "Projection to specific Lambda states in linear molecules"
msgstr "线性分子中向特定 Lambda 态的投影"

msgid ""
"*lam(i)* is the :math:`\\Lambda` quantum number of state :math:`i`, i.e., 0 "
"for :math:`\\Sigma` states, 1 for :math:`\\Pi` states, 2 for :math:`\\Delta`"
" states, etc. The matrix over :math:`\\Lambda^2` will be constructed and "
"diagonalized in the P-space configuration basis. The eigenvectors are used "
"to transform the P-space hamiltonian into a symmetry adapted basis, and the "
"program then selects the eigenvectors of the correct symmetry. The states "
"will be ordered by symmetry as specified on the ``LQUANT`` card; within each"
" symmetry, the states will be ordered according to increasing energy."
msgstr ""
"*lam(i)* 是状态 :math:`i` 的 :math:`\\Lambda` 量子数，即，对于 :math:`\\Sigma` 状态为 0，对于 "
":math:`\\Pi` 状态为 1，对于 :math:`\\Delta` 状态为 2，依此类推。将在 P 空间组态基中构造并对角化 "
":math:`\\Lambda^2` 的矩阵。特征向量用于将 P 空间哈密顿量变换到对称性适配基中，然后程序选择正确对称性的特征向量。状态将按照 "
"``LQUANT`` 卡片上指定的对称性排序；在每个对称性内部，状态将按照能量递增的顺序排序。"

msgid "Restoring and saving the orbitals and CI vectors"
msgstr "恢复和保存轨道与 CI 向量"

msgid ""
"MULTI normally requires a starting orbital guess. In this section we "
"describe how to define these orbitals, and how to save the optimized "
"orbitals. In a CASSCF calculation, one has the choice of transforming the "
"final orbitals to natural orbitals (the first order density matrix is "
"diagonalized), to pseudo-canonical orbitals (an effective Fock-operator is "
"diagonalized), or of localizing the orbitals."
msgstr ""
"MULTI 通常需要一个轨道初猜。在本节中，我们将描述如何定义这些轨道，以及如何保存优化后的轨道。在 CASSCF "
"计算中，可以选择将最终轨道转换为自然轨道（对角化一阶密度矩阵）、准正则轨道（对角化一个有效的 Fock 算符），或者将轨道定域化。"

msgid "Defining the starting orbitals"
msgstr "定义初始轨道"

msgid ""
"*record:* dump record containing starting orbitals. As usual, *record* has "
"the form *irec.ifil*, where *irec* is the record number (e.g., 2140), and "
"*ifil* the file number (usually 2). The *options* can be used to select "
"orbitals of a specific type; for details, see section `selecting orbitals "
"and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__."
msgstr ""
"*record:* 包含初始轨道的转储记录。通常，\\ *record* 的形式为 *irec.ifil*\\ ，其中 *irec* 是记录号（例如 "
"2140），\\ *ifil* 是文件号（通常为 2）。\\ *options* 可用于选择特定类型的轨道；详情请参阅章节 `选择轨道和密度矩阵 "
"(ORBITAL, DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-"
"density-matrices-orbital-density>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"If this card is missing, the program tries to find suitable starting "
"orbitals as follows:"
msgstr "如果缺少此卡片，程序将尝试按以下方式寻找合适的初始轨道："

msgid ""
"**First:** Try to read orbitals from the record specified on the ``ORBITAL``"
" card (or the corresponding default, see ``ORBITAL``). All files are "
"searched."
msgstr "**首先：** 尝试从 ``ORBITAL`` 卡片指定的记录（或相应的默认值，参见 ``ORBITAL``\\ ）读取轨道。将搜索所有文件。"

msgid ""
"**Second:** Try to find orbitals from the most recent MCSCF calculation. All"
" files are searched."
msgstr "**第二：** 尝试从最近的 MCSCF 计算中寻找轨道。所有文件都会被搜索。"

msgid ""
"**Third:** Try to find orbitals from the most recent SCF calculation. All "
"files are searched."
msgstr "**第三：** 尝试从最近的 SCF 计算中寻找轨道。所有文件都会被搜索。"

msgid "If no orbitals are found, a starting orbital guess is generated."
msgstr "如果未找到任何轨道，则会生成一个轨道初猜。"

msgid ""
"It is often useful to employ MCSCF orbitals from a neighbouring geometry as "
"starting guess (this will happen automatically if orbitals are found, see "
"the above defaults). Note, however, that frozen-core orbitals should always "
"be taken from an SCF or MCSCF calculation at the present geometry and must "
"be specified separately on the ``FROZEN`` card. Otherwise the program is "
"likely to stop with error “non-orthogonal core orbitals”. The program "
"remembers where to take the core orbitals from if these have been specified "
"on a ``FROZEN`` card in a previous MCSCF calculation."
msgstr ""
"通常，使用邻近几何结构的 MCSCF "
"轨道作为初始猜测是有用的（如果找到轨道，这将自动发生，请参见上述默认设置）。但请注意，冻结芯轨道应始终取自当前几何结构下的 SCF 或 MCSCF "
"计算，并且必须在 ``FROZEN`` 卡片上单独指定。否则程序很可能会因错误“非正交芯轨道”而停止。如果这些芯轨道在之前的 MCSCF 计算中已在 "
"``FROZEN`` 卡片上指定过，程序会记住从何处获取这些芯轨道。"

msgid "Defining the starting CI coefficients"
msgstr "定义初始 CI 系数"

msgid ""
"MULTI normally obtains configuration mixing coefficients by a robust "
"eigenvector solver that converges on the lowest eigenvalues, and applies a "
"phase convention such that the largest coefficient is forced to be positive."
" For most purposes, this approach is satisfactory."
msgstr ""
"MULTI "
"通常通过一个稳健的特征向量求解器获取构型混合系数，该求解器收敛于最低特征值，并应用一个相位约定，强制使最大系数为正。对于大多数目的，这种方法令人满意。"

msgid ""
"Sometimes one wants a guarantee that the CI vector is phase matched to that "
"of a previous geometry. This can be achieved by using ``SAVE,CI=``\\ "
"*record.file* (see section `saving the CI vectors and information for a "
"gradient calculation <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors-"
"and-information-for-a-gradient-calculation>`__) in the first job, and in the"
" restart,"
msgstr ""
"有时需要保证 CI 向量与先前几何结构的相位匹配。这可以通过在第一个作业中使用 ``SAVE,CI=``\\ *record.file*\\ （参见章节"
" `保存 CI 向量和梯度计算信息 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors-and-"
"information-for-a-gradient-calculation>`__\\ ），并在重启时使用"

msgid ""
"The phase convention applied for the rest of the calculation is then that, "
"for each optimised state, the largest coefficient in the original CI vector "
"defines the sign of the corresponding coefficient in the optimised vector."
msgstr "随后计算中应用的相位约定是：对于每个优化态，原始 CI 向量中最大的系数决定了优化向量中对应系数的符号。"

msgid "Rotating pairs of initial orbitals"
msgstr "旋转初始轨道对"

msgid ""
"Performs a :math:`2\\times 2` rotation of the initial orbitals *orb1* and "
"*orb2* in symmetry *sym* by *angle* degrees. With *angle*\\ =0 the orbitals "
"are exchanged. ``ROTATE`` is meaningful only after the ``START`` card. See "
"``MERGE`` for other possibilities to manipulate orbitals."
msgstr ""
"对对称性 *sym* 中的初始轨道 *orb1* 和 *orb2* 执行 :math:`2\\times 2` 旋转，旋转角度为 *angle* 度。当"
" *angle*\\ =0 时，轨道被交换。\\ ``ROTATE`` 仅在 ``START`` 卡片之后有意义。有关操作轨道的其他可能性，请参见 "
"``MERGE``\\ 。"

msgid "Saving the final orbitals"
msgstr "保存最终轨道"

msgid ""
"The orbitals are dumped to record *record.file*. Default for *record* is "
"2140 and *file=2*. This default record number is incremented by one for each"
" subsequent MCSCF calculation in the same job (see section `selecting "
"orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__). Therefore, if several different MCSCF calculations at "
"several geometries are performed in one job, each MCSCF will normally start "
"with appropriate orbitals even if no ``ORBITAL`` or ``START`` card is "
"present."
msgstr ""
"轨道被转储到记录 *record.file*\\ 。\\ *record* 的默认值为 2140，\\ *file=2*\\ "
"。在同一作业中，对于每个后续的 MCSCF 计算，此默认记录号会递增 1（参见章节 `选择轨道和密度矩阵 (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__\\ ）。因此，如果在一个作业中执行多个不同几何结构下的 MCSCF 计算，即使没有 ``ORBITAL`` 或 "
"``START`` 卡片，每个 MCSCF 通常也会从适当的轨道开始。"

msgid ""
"The ``ORBITAL`` card can be omitted if a ``NATORB, CANORB`` or ``LOCORB`` "
"card is present, since *orb* can also be specified on these cards (the same "
"defaults for  *orb* as above apply in these cases)."
msgstr ""
"如果存在 ``NATORB, CANORB`` 或 ``LOCORB`` 卡片，则可以省略 ``ORBITAL`` 卡片，因为 *orb* "
"也可以在这些卡片上指定（在这些情况下，\\ *orb* 适用与上述相同的默认值）。"

msgid "Natural orbitals"
msgstr "自然轨道"

msgid ""
"Request to calculate final natural orbitals and write them to record "
"*record*. The default for *record* is 2140.2, or what else has been "
"specified on an ``ORBITAL`` card, if present. By default, the orbitals are "
"not printed and the hamiltonian is not diagonalized for the new orbitals."
msgstr ""
"请求计算最终的自然轨道并将其写入记录 *record*\\ 。\\ *record* 的默认值为 2140.2，或者如果存在 ``ORBITAL`` "
"卡片，则使用该卡片上指定的值。默认情况下，轨道不会被打印，并且哈密顿量不会针对新轨道进行对角化。"

msgid "Options for printing the CI vectors and orbitals:"
msgstr "用于打印 CI 向量和轨道的选项："

msgid ""
"``PRINTCI`` or ``CI`` Transforms the CI vector according to the natural "
"orbitals and print the configurations and their associated coefficients. "
"This has the same effect as the ``GPRINT,CIVECTOR`` directive (see section "
"`global Print Options (GPRINT/NOGPRINT) <program_control.html#global-print-"
"options-gprint-nogprint>`__. By default, only configurations with "
"coefficients larger than 0.05 are printed. This threshold can be modified "
"using the ``THRESH`` (see section `convergence thresholds "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#convergence-thresholds>`__) or ``GTHRESH`` "
"(see section `global Thresholds (GTHRESH) <program_control.html#global-"
"thresholds-gthresh>`__) options."
msgstr ""
"``PRINTCI`` 或 ``CI`` 根据自然轨道变换 CI 向量，并打印组态及其关联的系数。这与 ``GPRINT,CIVECTOR`` "
"指令（参见 `全局打印选项 (GPRINT/NOGPRINT) <program_control.html#global-print-options-"
"gprint-nogprint>`__ 章节）具有相同的效果。默认情况下，仅打印系数大于 0.05 的组态。可以使用 ``THRESH``\\ （参见 "
"`收敛阈值 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#convergence-thresholds>`__ 章节）或 "
"``GTHRESH``\\ （参见 `全局阈值 (GTHRESH) <program_control.html#global-thresholds-"
"gthresh>`__ 章节）选项修改此阈值。"

msgid "Options for storing the CI vectors and orbitals:"
msgstr "用于存储 CI 向量和轨道的选项："

msgid ""
"Options for selecting the states included in the density from which the "
"natural orbitals are calculate (if not given, the state-averaged density is "
"considered):"
msgstr "用于选择包含在计算自然轨道的密度中的态的选项（若未给出，则考虑态平均密度）："

msgid ""
"Several ``NATORB, CANORB``, and ``LOCORB`` cards (for different states) may "
"follow each other. In contrast to earlier versions of Molpro the different "
"orbital sets can all be stored in one dump record (but different records "
"still work). See section `selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, "
"DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-"
"matrices-orbital-density>`__ for information about dump records and how "
"specific orbital sets can be requested in a later calculation."
msgstr ""
"多个 ``NATORB, CANORB`` 和 ``LOCORB`` 卡片（针对不同态）可以彼此跟随。与早期版本的 Molpro "
"不同，不同的轨道集可以全部存储在一个转储记录中（但不同的记录仍然有效）。有关转储记录以及如何在后续计算中请求特定轨道集的信息，请参阅 "
"`选择轨道和密度矩阵 (ORBITAL, DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-"
"orbitals-and-density-matrices-orbital-density>`__ 一节。"

msgid "Pseudo-canonical orbitals"
msgstr "准正则轨道"

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid ""
"Request to canonicalize the final orbitals, and writing them to record "
"*record*. All options have the same effect as described for ``NATORB``."
msgstr "请求将最终轨道正则化，并将其写入记录 *record*\\ 。所有选项的效果与 ``NATORB`` 中描述的相同。"

msgid "Localized orbitals"
msgstr "定域轨道"

msgid ""
"Request to localize the final orbitals, and writing them to record *record*."
" All options have the same effect as described for ``NATORB``."
msgstr "请求将最终轨道定域化，并将其写入记录 *record*\\ 。所有选项的效果与 ``NATORB`` 中描述的相同。"

msgid ""
"Note: ``LOCAL`` is interpreted by MULTI, but ``LOCALI`` is a separate "
"command which calls the localization program and not recognized by MULTI. In"
" order to avoid confusion, it is recommended to use ``LOCORB`` rather then "
"``LOCAL`` as subcommand within MULTI."
msgstr ""
"注意：\\ ``LOCAL`` 由 MULTI 解释，但 ``LOCALI`` 是一个单独的命令，它调用定域化程序且不被 MULTI "
"识别。为避免混淆，建议在 MULTI 内部使用 ``LOCORB`` 而非 ``LOCAL`` 作为子命令。"

msgid "Raw orbitals"
msgstr "原始轨道"

msgid ""
"The command stores the raw orbitals used in the optimization in the given "
"record *record*. All options have the same effect as described for "
"``NATORB``, except the options ``SPIN`` and ``STATE`` which have no effect. "
"The input orbitals stay unchanged if this is combined with ``dont,orbital``."
" However, if absolutely no changes in the orbitals are desired, the extra "
"symmetry treatment has to be manually switched off with the ``NOEXTRA`` "
"directive."
msgstr ""
"该命令将优化中使用的原始轨道存储在给定的记录 *record* 中。所有选项的效果与 ``NATORB`` 中描述的相同，但 ``SPIN`` 和 "
"``STATE`` 选项除外，它们没有效果。如果与 ``dont,orbital`` "
"结合使用，输入轨道将保持不变。然而，如果绝对不希望轨道发生任何变化，则必须使用 ``NOEXTRA`` 指令手动关闭额外对称性处理。"

msgid ""
"All printed `expectation values <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#calculating-"
"expectation-values>`__ are calculated from this orbital set."
msgstr ""
"所有打印的 `期望值 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#calculatingexpectationvalues>`__ "
"都是根据此轨道集计算的。"

msgid "Diabatic orbitals"
msgstr "透热轨道"

msgid ""
"In order to construct diabatic states, it is necessary to determine the "
"mixing of the diabatic states in the adiabatic wavefunctions. In principle, "
"this mixing can be obtained by integration of the non-adiabatic coupling "
"matrix elements. Often, it is much easier to use an approximate method, in "
"which the mixing is determined by inspection of the CI coefficients of the "
"MCSCF or CI wavefunctions. This method is applicable only if the orbital "
"mixing is negligible. For CASSCF wavefunctions this can be achieved by "
"maximizing the overlap of the active orbitals with those of a reference "
"geometry, at which the wavefunctions are assumed to be diabatic (e.g. for "
"symmetry reasons). The orbital overlap is maximized using using the new "
"``DIAB`` command in the ``MCSCF`` program. Only the active orbitals are "
"transformed."
msgstr ""
"为了构造透热态，需要确定透热态在绝热波函数中的混合。原则上，这种混合可以通过积分非绝热耦合矩阵元获得。通常，使用一种近似方法要容易得多，即通过检查 "
"MCSCF 或 CI 波函数的 CI 系数来确定混合。这种方法仅适用于轨道混合可以忽略不计的情况。对于 CASSCF "
"波函数，可以通过最大化活性轨道与参考几何结构（在该结构下波函数被假定为透热的，例如由于对称性原因）的活性轨道的重叠来实现。轨道重叠使用 "
"``MCSCF`` 程序中的新 ``DIAB`` 命令进行最大化。仅变换活性轨道。"

msgid "New form:"
msgstr "新格式："

msgid ""
"Here *orbref* is the record holding the orbitals of the reference geometry, "
"and *orbsav* is the record on which the new orbitals are stored. If *orbsav*"
" is not given (recommended!) the new orbitals are stored in the default dump"
" record (2140.2) or the one given on the ``ORBITAL`` directive (see section "
"`saving the final orbitals <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-final-"
"orbitals>`__). In contrast to earlier versions of Molpro  it is possible "
"that *orbref* and *orbsav* are the same. The specifications ``TYPE``, "
"``STATE``, ``SPIN`` can be used to select specific sets of reference "
"orbitals, as described in section `selecting orbitals and density matrices "
"(ORBITAL, DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-"
"density-matrices-orbital-density>`__. *orb1, orb2* is a pair of orbitals for"
" which the overlap is to be maximized. These orbitals are specified in the "
"form *number.sym*, e.g. 3.1 means the third orbital in symmetry 1. If *orb1,"
" orb2* are not given, the overlap of all active orbitals is maximized. *pri*"
" is a print parameter. If this is set to 1, the transformation angles for "
"each orbital are printed for each Jacobi iteration. *method* determines the "
"diabatization method. *method=1* (default): use Jacobi rotations; "
"*method=2*: use block diagonalization. Both methods yield very similar "
"results. *method=2* must only be used for CASSCF wavefunctions. *method=-1* "
"and *method=-2*: as the positive values, but AO overlap matrix of the "
"current geometry is used. This minimizes the change of the MO coefficients, "
"rather than maximizing the overlap to the neighbouring orbitals."
msgstr ""
"此处 *orbref* 是保存参考几何结构轨道的记录，\\ *orbsav* 是存储新轨道的记录。如果未指定 *orbsav*\\ "
"（推荐！），新轨道将存储在默认的转储记录（2140.2）或 ``ORBITAL`` 指令中给出的记录中（参见 `保存最终轨道 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-final-orbitals>`__ 一节）。与早期版本的 "
"Molpro  不同，\\ *orbref* 和 *orbsav* 可以是同一个记录。规范 ``TYPE``\\ 、\\ ``STATE``\\ 、\\"
" ``SPIN`` 可用于选择特定的参考轨道集，如 `选择轨道和密度矩阵（ORBITAL, DENSITY） "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ 一节所述。\\ *orb1, orb2* 是需要最大化重叠的一对轨道。这些轨道以 *number.sym* "
"的形式指定，例如 3.1 表示对称性 1 中的第三个轨道。如果未指定 *orb1, orb2*\\ ，则最大化所有活性轨道的重叠。\\ *pri* "
"是一个打印参数。如果设置为 1，则每次 Jacobi 迭代都会打印每个轨道的变换角度。\\ *method* 决定了非绝热化方法。\\ "
"*method=1*\\ （默认）：使用 Jacobi 旋转；\\ *method=2*\\ ：使用块对角化。两种方法产生非常相似的结果。\\ "
"*method=2* 必须仅用于 CASSCF 波函数。\\ *method=-1* 和 *method=-2*\\ ：与正值类似，但使用当前几何结构的"
" AO 重叠矩阵。这最小化了 MO 系数的变化，而不是最大化与相邻轨道的重叠。"

msgid ""
"Using the defaults described above, the following input is sufficient in "
"most cases:"
msgstr "使用上述默认设置，在大多数情况下以下输入就足够了："

msgid ""
"Since ``Molpro98`` it has not been necessary any more to give any ``GEOM`` "
"and ``DISPL`` cards. The displacements and overlap matrices are computed "
"automatically (the geometries are stored in the dump records, along with the"
" orbitals)."
msgstr ""
"自 ``Molpro98`` 起，不再需要提供任何 ``GEOM`` 和 ``DISPL`` "
"卡片。位移和重叠矩阵会自动计算（几何结构与轨道一起存储在转储记录中）。"

msgid ""
"Below we present an example for the first two excited states of H\\ "
":math:`_2`\\ S, which have :math:`B_1` and :math:`A_2` symmetry in "
":math:`C_{2v}`, and :math:`A''` symmetry in :math:`C_S`. We first perform a "
"reference calculation in :math:`C_{2v}` symmetry, and then determine the "
"diabatic orbitals for displaced geometries in :math:`C_S` symmetry. Each "
"subsequent calculation uses the previous orbitals as reference. One could "
"also use the orbitals of the :math:`C_{2v}` calculation as reference for all"
" other calculations. In this case one would have to take out the second-last"
" input card, which sets ``reforb=2141.2``."
msgstr ""
"下面我们以 H\\ :math:`_2`\\ S 的前两个激发态为例，它们在 :math:`C_{2v}` 中具有 :math:`B_1` 和 "
":math:`A_2` 对称性，在 :math:`C_S` 中具有 :math:`A''` 对称性。我们首先在 :math:`C_{2v}` "
"对称性下执行参考计算，然后确定在 :math:`C_S` 对称性下位移几何构型的绝热轨道。每个后续计算都使用前一次计算的轨道作为参考。也可以将 "
":math:`C_{2v}` 计算的轨道用作所有其他计算的参考。在这种情况下，必须移除倒数第二个输入卡，该卡设置了 "
"``reforb=2141.2``\\ 。"

msgid "Saving the CI vectors"
msgstr "保存 CI 向量"

msgid ""
"Exports the CI vector(s) at record *record* such that they can be read in as"
" a reference vector in the RS2, the RS2C, the MRCI, and the PNO-CASPT2 "
"programs as well as in the spin-orbit coupling program. A minimal example "
"for the MRCI program reads: {multi;save,cirec=5100.2}{mrci,cirec=5100.2;}. "
"The exported CI vectors are in the CSF basis which is used in nearly all "
"subsequent post MCSCF program. In case determinants are used in the (state-"
"averaged) MCSCF optimization, the CI vectors are automatically transformed "
"into the CSF basis during the export. This is also possible for averaging "
"over different spins!"
msgstr ""
"将记录 *record* 处的 CI 向量导出，以便它们可以在 RS2、RS2C、MRCI 和 PNO-CASPT2 程序以及自旋-"
"轨道耦合程序中作为参考向量读入。MRCI "
"程序的一个最小示例如下：{multi;save,cirec=5100.2}{mrci,cirec=5100.2;}。导出的 CI "
"向量采用组态态函数基组，该基组用于几乎所有后续的 MCSCF 后处理程序。如果在（态平均）MCSCF 优化中使用行列式，则在导出过程中 CI "
"向量会自动转换为组态态函数基组。这对于不同自旋的平均也是可能的！"

msgid ""
"**Important**: If more than a single ``WF`` card is specified, the CI record"
" is automatically increased by 100 for each ``WF`` card! This is implemented"
" since the CSF export is only able to store a single wavefunction "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"**重要**\\ ：如果指定了多个 ``WF`` 卡，则每个 ``WF`` 卡的 CI 记录会自动增加 "
"100！这是因为组态态函数导出只能存储单个波函数配置。"

msgid ""
"In case of multiple ``NATORB``, ``CANORB``, ``LOCORB``, or ``RAWORB`` cards,"
" the CI vector is only exported for the last card. If the CI vectors should "
"be exported for the different orbital cards, please use the ``CIREC`` option"
" in each orbital card (see `natural orbitals "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#natural-orbitals>`__)."
msgstr ""
"如果存在多个 ``NATORB``\\ 、\\ ``CANORB``\\ 、\\ ``LOCORB`` 或 ``RAWORB`` "
"卡，则仅导出最后一张卡的 CI 向量。如果应为不同的轨道卡导出 CI 向量，请在每张轨道卡中使用 ``CIREC`` 选项（参见 `自然轨道 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#naturalorbitals>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "Aliases for ``CIREC`` are: ``CIVEC`` and ``CIREF``"
msgstr "``CIREC`` 的别名有：\\ ``CIVEC`` 和 ``CIREF``"

msgid "Export the CI vectors in determinant form"
msgstr "以行列式形式导出 CI 向量"

msgid "``SAVE,DETCIREC``\\ =\\ *record* or ``SAVE,DET``\\ =\\ *record*"
msgstr "``SAVE,DETCIREC``\\ =\\ *record* 或 ``SAVE,DET``\\ =\\ *record*"

msgid ""
"An export of the CI vector in determinant form can be necessary for "
"restarting a determinant based ``MULTI`` with ``CIGUESS`` (see `defining the"
" starting CI coefficients <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#defining-the-"
"starting-ci-coefficients>`__) or if the CI vector is used in the `CASVB "
"program <the_vb_program_casvb.html#the-vb-program-casvb>`__."
msgstr ""
"以行列式形式导出 CI 向量可能是必要的，例如为了使用 ``CIGUESS`` 重启一个基于行列式的 ``MULTI`` 计算（参见 `定义起始 CI "
"系数 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#definingthestartingcicoefficients>`__\\ "
"），或者当 CI 向量用于 `CASVB 程序 <the_vb_program_casvb.html#thevbprogramcasvb>`__ 时。"

msgid ""
"In contrast to the CSF export, all CI vectors of different WF cards are "
"stored in the same specified record. An export for different orbital cards "
"is possible as well, e.g. ``natorb,2140.2,detcirec=5100.2``. Also, the "
"export in determinant and CSF basis can be combined, e.g. "
"``save,detcirec=4100.2,cirec=5100.2``."
msgstr ""
"与 CSF 导出不同，所有不同 WF 卡的 CI 向量都存储在同一个指定的记录中。也可以为不同的轨道卡进行导出，例如 "
"``natorb,2140.2,detcirec=5100.2``\\ 。此外，行列式基组和 CSF 基组的导出可以组合使用，例如 "
"``save,detcirec=4100.2,cirec=5100.2``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Saving information for single-state or state-averaged gradient calculations"
msgstr "保存用于单态或态平均梯度计算的信息"

msgid ""
"*grdsav:* record name for saving the information which is needed in a "
"subsequent gradient calculation. This save is done automatically to record "
"5000.1 if the input contains a ``FORCE`` or ``OPTG`` card, and therefore, "
"the ``GRD`` option is mostly not required."
msgstr ""
"*grdsav:* 用于保存后续梯度计算所需信息的记录名称。如果输入中包含 ``FORCE`` 或 ``OPTG`` 卡片，则会自动保存到记录 "
"5000.1，因此，\\ ``GRD`` 选项通常不是必需的。"

msgid "First-order MCSCF (for large molecules)"
msgstr "一阶 MCSCF（适用于大分子）"

msgid ""
"First-order methods allow the treatment of larger molecules by avoiding the "
"construction of the full orbital Hessian. Since Molpro Version 2020, the "
"first-order MCSCF is the default for density fitting calculations. "
"Nevertheless, the implementation can be also used without density fitting by"
" setting the following option:"
msgstr ""
"一阶方法通过避免构建完整的轨道 Hessian 矩阵，使得处理更大分子成为可能。自 Molpro 2020 版起，一阶 MCSCF "
"已成为密度拟合计算的默认方法。尽管如此，通过设置以下选项，该实现也可在不使用密度拟合的情况下使用："

msgid "{``MULTI``,\\ ``FIRST-ORDER``;...} or {``MULTI``,\\ ``FO``;...}"
msgstr "{``MULTI``,\\ ``FIRST-ORDER``;…} 或 {``MULTI``,\\ ``FO``;…}"

msgid ""
"There are several different first-order methods implemented in Molpro. They "
"can be activated by the options given below. More details about the "
"different first-order implementations can be found in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5142241>`__ **152**, 074102 (2020)."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 中实现了多种不同的一阶方法。它们可以通过下面给出的选项激活。关于不同一阶实现的更多细节，请参阅 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5142241>`__ **152**, 074102 (2020)。"

msgid "Combined first- and second-order optimization (default)"
msgstr "结合一阶和二阶优化（默认）"

msgid ""
"This method combines the second-order optimization of the active orbitals "
"with the first-order Super-CI method. The computation time per iteration is "
"only slightly higher compared to the Super-CI method while convergence is "
"more robust. This is the default first-order MCSCF method and is equivalent "
"to the ``FIRST-ORDER`` command. The following option is available for the "
"SO-SCI method:"
msgstr ""
"该方法将活性轨道的二阶优化与一阶 Super-CI 方法相结合。每次迭代的计算时间仅比 Super-CI 方法略高，而收敛性更加稳健。这是一阶 "
"MCSCF 的默认方法，等同于 ``FIRST-ORDER`` 命令。SO-SCI 方法有以下可用选项："

msgid ""
"``SO_SCI_WMK_ACT`` Starts the optimization with a WMK optimization of the "
"active-virtual rotations (default: 0). This can save iterations, if virtual "
"orbitals are expected to swap into the active space, e.g. Rydberg orbitals."
msgstr ""
"``SO_SCI_WMK_ACT`` 以活性-虚轨道旋转的 WMK "
"优化开始优化（默认值：0）。如果预期虚轨道（例如里德伯轨道）会交换进入活性空间，这可以节省迭代次数。"

msgid "Super-CI"
msgstr "Super-CI"

msgid "Activates the Super-CI implementation."
msgstr "激活 Super-CI 实现。"

msgid "UC-AH"
msgstr "UC-AH"

msgid ""
"Activates the uncoupled augmented Hessian method (UC-AH). This method "
"includes the exact orbital Hessian, and it is only recommended for small "
"molecules."
msgstr "激活非耦合增广 Hessian 方法（UC-AH）。该方法包含精确的轨道 Hessian 矩阵，仅推荐用于小分子。"

msgid "Second-order MCSCF"
msgstr "二阶 MCSCF"

msgid ""
"An improved second-order MCSCF implementation is available since Molpro "
"2018. It is a reimplementation of the 1984 version and features several "
"technical improvements as for example the L-BFGS convergence acceleration. "
"More details about the implementation can be found in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5094644>`__ **150**, 194106 (2019). The "
"second-order MCSCF method features a larger convergence radius and it "
"sometimes finds lower minima. However, the cost per iterations are higher "
"than in the first-order implementation due to the computation of the full "
"orbital Hessian. Therefore, we recommend the second-order methods for "
"calculations with smaller molecules. The second-order MCSCF is the default "
"method for calculations without density fitting. For density fitting, the "
"second-order MCSCF can be activated by:"
msgstr ""
"自 Molpro 2018 起，提供了改进的二阶 MCSCF 实现。这是对 1984 年版本的重实现，并包含多项技术改进，例如 L-BFGS "
"收敛加速。有关实现的更多详细信息，请参阅 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5094644>`__ **150**, 194106 (2019)。二阶 MCSCF "
"方法具有更大的收敛半径，有时能找到更低的极小值。然而，由于需要计算完整的轨道 Hessian "
"矩阵，每次迭代的成本高于一阶实现。因此，我们建议对较小的分子使用二阶方法。对于不使用密度拟合的计算，二阶 MCSCF "
"是默认方法。对于密度拟合，可以通过以下方式激活二阶 MCSCF："

msgid "{``DF-MULTI``,\\ ``SECOND-ORDER``;...} or {``DF-MULTI``,\\ ``SO``;...}"
msgstr "{``DF-MULTI``,\\ ``SECOND-ORDER``;…} 或 {``DF-MULTI``,\\ ``SO``;…}"

msgid "New implementation of the WMK method (default)"
msgstr "WMK 方法的新实现（默认）"

msgid ""
"This is the new second-order MCSCF implementation and this command is "
"equivalent to the ``SECOND-ORDER`` command. By default, the L-BFGS "
"acceleration is activated. If the L-BFGS acceleration is switched off "
"(``MULTI,QN=0``) the following options are available to change the "
"optimization strategy i the micro-iterations."
msgstr ""
"这是新的二阶 MCSCF 实现，此命令等同于 ``SECOND-ORDER`` 命令。默认情况下，L-BFGS 加速已激活。如果关闭 L-BFGS "
"加速（\\ ``MULTI,QN=0``\\ ），则以下选项可用于更改微迭代中的优化策略。"

msgid ""
"``TWO_STEP_MODE=0`` Selects strategy automatically, default for ``QN=0``."
msgstr "``TWO_STEP_MODE=0`` 自动选择策略，\\ ``QN=0`` 时的默认设置。"

msgid ""
"``TWO_STEP_MODE=1`` Uncoupled (CI), strategy with less CI optimization steps"
" for large active spaces"
msgstr "``TWO_STEP_MODE=1`` 非耦合（CI）策略，对于大活性空间使用较少的 CI 优化步长"

msgid ""
"``TWO_STEP_MODE=2`` Uncoupled (Orb), strategy with less orbital optimization"
" steps for a large number of orbitals"
msgstr "``TWO_STEP_MODE=2`` 非耦合（轨道）策略，对于大量轨道使用较少的轨道优化步长"

msgid ""
"More details about the different strategies can be found in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5094644>`__ **150**, 194106 (2019)."
msgstr ""
"关于不同策略的更多细节，请参阅 `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5094644>`__ "
"**150**, 194106 (2019)。"

msgid "Old implementation of the WMK method"
msgstr "WMK 方法的旧实现"

msgid ""
"This activates the original second-order implementation of 1984, which was "
"the default method in Molpro 2015 and earlier."
msgstr "这会激活 1984 年的原始二阶实现，该方法是 Molpro 2015 及更早版本中的默认方法。"

msgid "Coupled optimization"
msgstr "耦合优化"

msgid ""
"This second-order MCSCF optimization includes the explicit coupling between "
"the reduced CI space obtained from the Davidson method and the orbitals. "
"Additional CI expansion vectors obtained from the coupled residuum are "
"included increasing the level of coupling. Through the explicit coupling, "
"the convergence is more stable, but considerable more CI steps are required."
msgstr ""
"此二阶 MCSCF 优化包含了从 Davidson 方法获得的简化 CI 空间与轨道之间的显式耦合。包含了从耦合残差获得的额外 CI "
"展开向量，从而增加了耦合程度。通过显式耦合，收敛更加稳定，但需要相当多的 CI 步骤。"

msgid "The level of coupling can be set by the following options:"
msgstr "耦合程度可以通过以下选项设置："

msgid ""
"``ADDTHR`` Threshold for adding additional expansion vectors to the reduced "
"CI space (default: ``ADDTHR``\\ =0.05). Expansion vectors are added until "
"the relative energy change is lower than the threshold. Hence, a lower "
"threshold increases the level of coupling by adding more additional "
"expansion vectors. CI computation steps are required for each additional "
"expansion vector."
msgstr ""
"``ADDTHR`` 向约化 CI 空间添加额外展开向量的阈值（默认：\\ ``ADDTHR``\\ "
"=0.05）。添加展开向量直到相对能变化低于该阈值。因此，较低的阈值会通过添加更多额外展开向量来增加耦合程度。每个额外展开向量都需要 CI 计算步骤。"

msgid ""
"``NADD`` Maximal number of additional expansion vectors obtained from the "
"coupled residuum (default: ``NADD``\\ =5). It is possible to add no "
"additional expansion vectors by setting ``NADD``\\ =0."
msgstr ""
"``NADD`` 从耦合残差中获取的额外展开向量的最大数量（默认：\\ ``NADD``\\ =5）。可以通过设置 ``NADD``\\ =0 "
"来不添加任何额外展开向量。"

msgid ""
"``EXCLUDECIROT`` Option for excluding CI rotations between the new expansion"
" vectors and the CI state vectors if the associated gradients are tiny. "
"(default: ``EXCLUDECIROT``\\ =1)"
msgstr ""
"``EXCLUDECIROT`` 如果关联梯度极小，则排除新展开向量与 CI 态向量之间 CI 旋转的选项。（默认：\\ "
"``EXCLUDECIROT``\\ =1）"

msgid "Tools for the MCSCF wavefunction"
msgstr "MCSCF 波函数工具"

msgid "CAS-CI"
msgstr "CAS-CI"

msgid "{``CAS-CI``;...} or {``MULTI``,\\ ``CAS-CI``;...}"
msgstr "{``CAS-CI``;…} 或 {``MULTI``,\\ ``CAS-CI``;…}"

msgid ""
"Performs a CI optimization (equivalent to ``dont,orbital``) without changing"
" the orbitals. The same directives as in multi are available, hence the CI "
"optimization with orbital restrictions are also possible. Following options "
"are available for controlling the CAS-CI convergence:"
msgstr ""
"执行 CI 优化（等效于 ``dont,orbital``\\ ）而不改变轨道。可使用与 multi 中相同的指令，因此带轨道限制的 CI "
"优化也是可能的。以下选项可用于控制 CAS-CI 收敛："

msgid ""
"``CAS_CI_EDIFF`` Threshold for the CAS-CI energy convergence (default: "
"1d-10). Convergence is reached, if the energy difference of two subsequent "
"iterations is lower than the given threshold."
msgstr "``CAS_CI_EDIFF`` CAS-CI 能量收敛阈值（默认：1d-10）。如果两次连续迭代的能量差低于给定阈值，则达到收敛。"

msgid ""
"``CAS_CI_RES`` Threshold for the CAS-CI residuum convergence (default: "
"1d-7). Convergence is reached, if the residuum is lower than the given "
"threshold."
msgstr "``CAS_CI_RES`` CAS-CI 残差收敛阈值（默认值：1d-7）。当残差低于给定阈值时，即达到收敛。"

msgid ""
"``CAS_CI_MAXIT`` Maximal number of Davidson iterations in the CAS-CI "
"optimization (default: 100)."
msgstr "``CAS_CI_MAXIT`` CAS-CI 优化中戴维森迭代的最大次数（默认值：100）。"

msgid ""
"In contrast to the MCSCF optimization, the input orbitals are not changed "
"(equivalent to `RAWORB <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#raw-orbitals>`__). If "
"natural or canonical orbitals are desired, the additional directive has to "
"be added to the input. Note that the extra symmetry treatment has to be "
"manually switched off with the ``NOEXTRA`` directive, if absolutely no "
"changes in the orbitals are desired."
msgstr ""
"与 MCSCF 优化不同，输入的轨道不会被改变（相当于 `RAWORB "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#raworbitals>`__\\ "
"）。如果需要自然轨道或正则轨道，则必须在输入中添加额外的指令。请注意，如果绝对不希望轨道发生任何改变，则必须使用 ``NOEXTRA`` "
"指令手动关闭额外对称性处理。"

msgid "Orbital Hessian eigenvalues"
msgstr "轨道 Hessian 矩阵特征值"

msgid ""
"Calculates and prints the eigenvalues of the orbital Hessian for a given set"
" of orbitals. A CAS-CI optimization is done before building the orbital "
"Hessian. The options in `CAS-CI <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cas-ci>`__ can"
" be used for controlling the CI optimization."
msgstr ""
"计算并打印给定轨道集的轨道 Hessian 矩阵特征值。在构建轨道 Hessian 矩阵之前会进行 CAS-CI 优化。\\ `CAS-CI "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cas-ci>`__ 中的选项可用于控制 CI 优化。"

msgid ""
"``HESS_EIG_NEIG`` Number of calculated and printed eigenvalues (default: "
"10)."
msgstr "``HESS_EIG_NEIG`` 计算并打印的特征值数量（默认值：10）。"

msgid ""
"``HESS_EIG_REDUNDANT`` If set one, includes redundant rotations (default: "
"0). One should remove all FREEZE and FROZEN directives and add the NOEXTRA "
"directive for including all possible orbital rotations."
msgstr ""
"``HESS_EIG_REDUNDANT`` 如果设置为 1，则包含冗余旋转（默认值：0）。为了包含所有可能的轨道旋转，应移除所有 FREEZE 和 "
"FROZEN 指令，并添加 NOEXTRA 指令。"

msgid ""
"``HESS_EIG_EDIFF`` Threshold for the eigenvalue convergence in the "
"diagonalization (default: 1d-10). Convergence is reached, if the eigenvalue "
"difference of two subsequent iterations is lower than the given threshold."
msgstr ""
"``HESS_EIG_EDIFF`` 对角化中特征值收敛的阈值（默认值：1d-10）。如果连续两次迭代的特征值之差低于给定阈值，则认为达到收敛。"

msgid ""
"``HESS_EIG_RES`` Threshold for the residuum convergence in the "
"diagonalization (default: 1d-7). Convergence is reached, if the residuum is "
"lower than the given threshold."
msgstr "``HESS_EIG_RES`` 对角化中残差收敛的阈值（默认值：1d-7）。如果残差低于给定阈值，则认为达到收敛。"

msgid ""
"``HESS_EIG_MAXIT`` Maximal number of Davidson iterations in the Hessian "
"diagonalization (default: 100)."
msgstr "``HESS_EIG_MAXIT`` Hessian 矩阵对角化中戴维森迭代的最大次数（默认值：100）。"

msgid "Options of the MCSCF program"
msgstr "MCSCF 程序的选项"

msgid ""
"The following options are given after the multi command, e.g. "
"``MULTI,QN=0;``"
msgstr "以下选项在 multi 命令后给出，例如 ``MULTI,QN=0;``"

msgid "Exclusive options for the first-order MCSCF"
msgstr "一阶 MCSCF 的专有选项"

msgid ""
"``FO_TRUST_RADIUS`` Size of the trust radius in the orbital optimization "
"(default: 1.5)."
msgstr "``FO_TRUST_RADIUS`` 轨道优化中信赖域的大小（默认值：1.5）。"

msgid ""
"``FO_CI_FAC`` Factor by which the CI residuum is lowered in each macro-"
"iteration (default: 0.1)."
msgstr "``FO_CI_FAC`` 每个宏迭代中 CI 残差降低的因子（默认值：0.1）。"

msgid ""
"``FO_CI_MAXIT`` Maximal number of CI Davidson iterations performed in each "
"macro-iteration (default: 10). If poor convergence of the CI problem is "
"expected, convergence might be improved by increasing this number."
msgstr ""
"``FO_CI_MAXIT`` 每个宏迭代中执行的 CI 戴维森迭代的最大次数（默认值：10）。如果预期 CI "
"问题收敛性较差，增加此数值可能会改善收敛。"

msgid "Exclusive options for the second-order MCSCF"
msgstr "二阶 MCSCF 的专属选项"

msgid ""
"``SO_TRUST_RADIUS`` Size of the trust radius in the orbital optimization "
"(default: 0.4)."
msgstr "``SO_TRUST_RADIUS`` 轨道优化中的信赖域大小（默认值：0.4）。"

msgid ""
"``SO_CI_MAXIT`` Maximal number of CI Davidson iterations performed in each "
"micro-iteration (default: 10)."
msgstr "``SO_CI_MAXIT`` 每个微迭代中执行的 CI 戴维森迭代的最大次数（默认值：10）。"

msgid ""
"``SO_CI_FAC`` Factor by which the CI residuum is lowered in each micro-"
"iteration (default: 0.3)."
msgstr "``SO_CI_FAC`` 每个微迭代中 CI 残差降低的因子（默认值：0.3）。"

msgid ""
"``SO_INTOPT_MAXIT`` Maximal number of micro-iterations in the internal "
"optimization (default: 4)."
msgstr "``SO_INTOPT_MAXIT`` 内部优化中微迭代的最大次数（默认值：4）。"

msgid "``SO_MICRO_MAXIT`` Maximal number of micro-iterations (default: 20)."
msgstr "``SO_MICRO_MAXIT`` 微迭代的最大次数（默认值：20）。"

msgid "Options of the L-BFGS convergence acceleration"
msgstr "L-BFGS 收敛加速的选项"

msgid ""
"``QN`` Activates the L-BFGS convergence acceleration in first- and second-"
"order MCSCF (default: 1)."
msgstr "``QN`` 在一阶和二阶 MCSCF 中激活 L-BFGS 收敛加速（默认值：1）。"

msgid "``QN_CI`` Include the CI in the L-BFGS acceleration (default: 1)."
msgstr "``QN_CI`` 在 L-BFGS 加速中包含 CI（默认值：1）。"

msgid ""
"``QN_START`` The L-BFGS acceleration is started after reaching the given "
"macro-iteration (default: 4)."
msgstr "``QN_START`` L-BFGS 加速在达到给定的宏迭代后启动（默认值：4）。"

msgid ""
"``QN_STEP`` The L-BFGS acceleration is started after reaching the given step"
" size (default: 0.1)."
msgstr "``QN_STEP`` L-BFGS 加速在达到给定的步长后启动（默认值：0.1）。"

msgid ""
"``QN_DENS`` The L-BFGS acceleration is reseted if the change in the averaged"
" density is larger than the given value (default: 0.5)."
msgstr "``QN_DENS`` 如果平均密度的变化大于给定值，则重置 L-BFGS 加速（默认值：0.5）。"

msgid ""
"``QN_ENERGY`` The L-BFGS acceleration is reseted if the energy increases "
"(default: 1)."
msgstr "``QN_ENERGY`` 如果能量增加，则重置 L-BFGS 加速（默认值：1）。"

msgid ""
"``QN_STEP_LENGTH`` Maximal step length in the orbital optimization, if the "
"QN acceleration is activated (default: 0.5)."
msgstr "``QN_STEP_LENGTH`` 如果激活了 QN 加速，轨道优化中的最大步长（默认值：0.5）。"

msgid "Options of the augmented Hessian method"
msgstr "增广 Hessian 方法的选项"

msgid ""
"``AUGH_MAXIT`` Maximal number of Davidson iterations in the augmented "
"Hessian solver (default: 10). If a large number of micro-iterations is "
"observed, convergence might be improved by increasing this number."
msgstr ""
"``AUGH_MAXIT`` 增广 Hessian 求解器中戴维森迭代的最大次数（默认值：10）。如果观察到大量微迭代，增加此数值可能会改善收敛性。"

msgid ""
"``AUGH_FAC`` Orbital gradient times this factor gives the accuracy of the "
"Davidson method in the augmented Hessian solver. (default: 0.1)"
msgstr "``AUGH_FAC`` 轨道梯度乘以该因子得到增广 Hessian 求解器中戴维森方法的精度（默认值：0.1）。"

msgid ""
"``AUGH_DAMPING`` Activates damping in the augmented Hessian solver (default:"
" 1)"
msgstr "``AUGH_DAMPING`` 在增广 Hessian 求解器中激活阻尼（默认值：1）"

msgid ""
"``AUGH_DAMPING_START`` Start value of the damping in the augmented Hessian "
"solver (default: 1.0). Increased damping reduces the step-size."
msgstr "``AUGH_DAMPING_START`` 增广 Hessian 求解器中阻尼的起始值（默认值：1.0）。增加阻尼会减小步长。"

msgid "Level shifts"
msgstr "能级位移"

msgid ""
"Level shifts for the closed-shell and active orbitals. These options are "
"similar to the Hartree-Fock program (see `options "
"<the_scf_program.html#options>`__), and they can be helpful for non-"
"converging multi calculations. Often, a good starting point is ``SHIFTC``\\ "
"=-0.3 and ``SHIFTO``\\ =-0.15. A large negative level shift might slow down "
"the convergence considerably."
msgstr ""
"用于闭壳层和活性轨道的能级位移。这些选项与 Hartree-Fock 程序类似（参见 `options "
"<the_scf_program.html#options>`__\\ ），并且对于不收敛的多重态计算可能有所帮助。通常，一个良好的起点是 "
"``SHIFTC``\\ =-0.3 和 ``SHIFTO``\\ =-0.15。较大的负能级位移可能会显著减慢收敛速度。"

msgid "``SHIFTC`` Level shift for the closed-shell orbitals (default: 0.0)."
msgstr "``SHIFTC`` 闭壳层轨道的能级位移（默认值：0.0）。"

msgid "``SHIFTO`` Level shift for the active orbitals (default: 0.0)."
msgstr "``SHIFTO`` 活性轨道的能级位移（默认值：0.0）。"

msgid "``SHIFT_AUTO`` Automatic adjustments of the level shifts (default: 1)."
msgstr "``SHIFT_AUTO`` 能级位移的自动调整（默认值：1）。"

msgid "Various more options"
msgstr "其他更多选项"

msgid "``MAXP_CI`` Max. number of P-space CI configurations (default: 400)"
msgstr "``MAXP_CI`` P空间CI构型的最大数量（默认值：400）"

msgid "``MAXP_ROT`` Number of P-space rotations (default: 200)"
msgstr "``MAXP_ROT`` P空间旋转的数量（默认值：200）"

msgid ""
"``START_CI`` If set to one, the CI is fully convergence in the first macro-"
"iteration (default: 0). This is done automatically, if the starting orbitals"
" have been optimized with the MCSCF program."
msgstr ""
"``START_CI`` 如果设置为1，则在第一次宏迭代中完全收敛CI（默认值：0）。如果起始轨道已通过MCSCF程序优化，则会自动执行此操作。"

msgid ""
"``EXACT_DIAG`` If set one, the Hamiltonian is diagonalized exactly (default:"
" 0)"
msgstr "``EXACT_DIAG`` 如果设置为1，则哈密顿量被精确对角化（默认值：0）"

msgid ""
"``SPINCHECK`` Checks for spin contamination when using determinants "
"(default: 1)"
msgstr "``SPINCHECK`` 在使用行列式时检查自旋污染（默认值：1）"

msgid ""
"``VERBOSITY`` Level of print out information (default: 1). Showing all "
"possible information at VERBOSITY=4."
msgstr "``VERBOSITY`` 输出信息的详细程度（默认值：1）。在 VERBOSITY=4 时显示所有可能的信息。"

msgid ""
"``MANY_STATES`` Activates an alternative CI solver which is more specialized"
" on many CI states."
msgstr "``MANY_STATES`` 激活一个替代的 CI 求解器，该求解器更专门针对多个 CI 态。"

msgid "Directives of the MCSCF program"
msgstr "MCSCF 程序的指令"

msgid "The following directives are given as ``MULTI;CONFIG,CSF;``."
msgstr "以下指令以 ``MULTI;CONFIG,CSF;`` 的形式给出。"

msgid "Selecting the CI method"
msgstr "选择 CI 方法"

msgid ""
"*key* may be ``DET`` or ``CSF``, and defaults to ``CSF``. If no ``CONFIG`` "
"or ``SELECT`` card is given, the default is determinants (CASSCF)."
msgstr ""
"*key* 可以是 ``DET`` 或 ``CSF``\\ ，默认为 ``CSF``\\ 。如果未给出 ``CONFIG`` 或 ``SELECT`` "
"卡片，则默认为行列式（CASSCF）。"

msgid "Disabling the optimization"
msgstr "禁用优化"

msgid ""
"Some procedures can be disabled more simply using the ``DONT`` directive. "
"``DONT``,\\ *code* where *code* may be"
msgstr "某些过程可以使用 ``DONT`` 指令更简单地禁用。\\ ``DONT``,\\ *code* 其中 *code* 可以是"

msgid "``ORBITAL`` Do initial CI but don’t optimize orbitals."
msgstr "``ORBITAL`` 执行初始 CI 但不优化轨道。"

msgid ""
"``WAVEFUNC`` Do not optimize the orbitals and CI coefficients (i.e. do only "
"wavefunction analysis, provided the orbitals and CI coefficients are "
"supplied (see ``START card``))."
msgstr ""
"``WAVEFUNC`` 不优化轨道和 CI 系数（即仅执行波函数分析，前提是提供了轨道和 CI 系数（参见 ``START card``\\ ））。"

msgid "``WVFN`` Alias for WAVEFUNC."
msgstr "``WVFN`` WAVEFUNC 的别名。"

msgid "``ANAL`` Do no wavefunction analysis."
msgstr "``ANAL`` 不进行波函数分析。"

msgid ""
"``EXPEC`` Skip the calculation of the transition and expectation values."
msgstr "``EXPEC`` 跳过跃迁和期望值的计算。"

msgid "Disabling the extra symmetry mechanism"
msgstr "禁用额外对称性机制"

msgid "``NOEXTRA``"
msgstr "``NOEXTRA``"

msgid ""
"This card disables the search for extra symmetries. By default, if extra "
"symmetries are present, each orbital is assigned to such an extra symmetry "
"and rotations between orbitals of different extra symmetry are not "
"performed."
msgstr ""
"此卡片禁用对额外对称性的搜索。默认情况下，如果存在额外对称性，每个轨道都会被分配一个这样的额外对称性，并且不会在不同额外对称性的轨道之间执行旋转。"

msgid "Print options"
msgstr "打印选项"

msgid ""
"requests the occupied and *nvirt* virtual orbitals in each symmetry to be "
"printed (default *nvirt*\\ =0). By default, the program does not print the "
"orbitals, unless the ``ORBPRINT`` directive or a global ``GPRINT,ORBITALS`` "
"(see section `global Print Options (GPRINT/NOGPRINT) "
"<program_control.html#global-print-options-gprint-nogprint>`__) command is "
"present. Specific orbital sets can be printed using the ``PRINT`` option on "
"a ``NATORB``, ``CANORB``, or ``LOCORB`` card (see section `natural orbitals "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#natural-orbitals>`__)."
msgstr ""
"请求打印每个对称性中的占据轨道和 *nvirt* 个虚轨道（默认 *nvirt*\\ =0）。默认情况下，程序不会打印轨道，除非存在 "
"``ORBPRINT`` 指令或全局的 ``GPRINT,ORBITALS`` 命令（参见 `全局打印选项 (GPRINT/NOGPRINT) "
"<program_control.html#global-print-options-gprint-nogprint>`__ 一节）。可以使用 "
"``NATORB``\\ 、\\ ``CANORB`` 或 ``LOCORB`` 卡片上的 ``PRINT`` 选项来打印特定的轨道集（参见 `自然轨道"
" <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#natural-orbitals>`__ 一节）。"

msgid "To print additional information at the end of the calculation, use"
msgstr "要在计算结束时打印额外信息，请使用"

msgid ""
"Printing is switched on for *key1*, *key2*,\\ :math:`\\ldots` . To print "
"information in each iteration, use"
msgstr "为 *key1*\\ 、\\ *key2*\\ 、\\ :math:`\\ldots` 开启打印。要在每次迭代中打印信息，请使用"

msgid "Possible print keys are:"
msgstr "可能的打印键有："

msgid ""
"``MICRO`` print details of “microiterations” — useful for finding out what’s"
" going wrong if no convergence"
msgstr "``MICRO`` 打印“微迭代”的详细信息 — 在无法收敛时用于找出问题所在"

msgid "``PSPACE`` print list of configurations making up the “primary” space"
msgstr "``PSPACE`` 打印构成“主”空间的组态列表"

msgid "``ORBITALS`` print orbitals (see also ``ORBPRINT``)"
msgstr "``ORBITALS`` 打印轨道（另见 ``ORBPRINT``\\ ）"

msgid "``NATORB`` print natural orbitals (see also ``ORBPRINT``)"
msgstr "``NATORB`` 打印自然轨道（另见 ``ORBPRINT``\\ ）"

msgid "``CIVECTOR`` print CI vector (better use ``CANORB`` or ``NATORB``)"
msgstr "``CIVECTOR`` 打印 CI 向量（最好使用 ``CANORB`` 或 ``NATORB``\\ ）"

msgid "``STEP`` Prints information about the orbital rotations"
msgstr "``STEP`` 打印关于轨道旋转的信息"

msgid "``GRADIENT`` print gradient"
msgstr "``GRADIENT`` 打印梯度"

msgid "Convergence thresholds"
msgstr "收敛阈值"

msgid "Convergence thresholds can be modified using"
msgstr "收敛阈值可通过以下方式修改"

msgid ""
"The default values can be modified using the global ``GTHRESH`` command (see"
" section `global Thresholds (GTHRESH) <program_control.html#global-"
"thresholds-gthresh>`__). Normally, the above default values are appropriate."
msgstr ""
"默认值可通过全局 ``GTHRESH`` 命令修改（参见章节 `全局阈值 (GTHRESH) <program_control.html#global-"
"thresholds-gthresh>`__\\ ）。通常，上述默认值是合适的。"

msgid "Maximum number of iterations"
msgstr "最大迭代次数"

msgid ""
"*maxit* is maximum number of iterations (default 20). If the calculation "
"does not converge in the default number of iterations, you should first "
"think about the reason before increasing the limit. In most cases the choice"
" of active orbitals or of the optimized states is not appropriate (see "
"introduction of MULTI). The maximum allowed value of *maxit* is 40. If the "
"calculation has not converged in this number of iterations, it is likely "
"that the active space is not reasonable. Note: slow convergence can occur in"
" RASSCF calculations if single excitations into weakly occupied orbitals are"
" present. These should be eliminated using"
msgstr ""
"*maxit* 是最大迭代次数（默认 "
"20）。如果计算在默认迭代次数内未收敛，在增加限制之前应首先思考原因。在大多数情况下，活性轨道的选择或优化态的选择不恰当（参见 MULTI "
"的引言）。\\ *maxit* 的最大允许值为 40。如果计算在此迭代次数内仍未收敛，则活性空间很可能不合理。注意：在 RASSCF "
"计算中，如果存在向弱占据轨道的单激发，可能会出现收敛缓慢的情况。应使用"

msgid "Special optimization parameters (old implementation)"
msgstr "特殊优化参数（旧实现）"

msgid ""
"This is only available for the WMK program activated by ``MULTI``,\\ "
"``WMK_OLD``. The following parameters can also be given as options on the "
"``MULTI`` command line."
msgstr ""
"这仅适用于由 ``MULTI``,\\ ``WMK_OLD`` 激活的 WMK 程序。以下参数也可以作为 ``MULTI`` 命令行上的选项给出。"

msgid "``FAILSAFE``"
msgstr "``FAILSAFE``"

msgid "Use options for more robust convergence"
msgstr "使用选项以获得更稳健的收敛"

msgid "Special parameters for augmented hessian method. For experts only!"
msgstr "增广 Hessian 方法的特殊参数。仅供专家使用！"

msgid ""
"Use G-operator technique in microiterations (Default). If igop.lt.0 do not "
"use G-operators."
msgstr "在微迭代中使用 G-算子技术（默认）。如果 igop.lt.0，则不使用 G-算子。"

msgid "Special parameters for the direct CI method. For experts only!"
msgstr "直接 CI 方法的特殊参数。仅供专家使用！"

msgid "Special parameters for internal optimization scheme. For experts only!"
msgstr "内部优化方案的特殊参数。仅供专家使用！"

msgid ""
"Special parameters for non-linear optimization scheme. For experts only!"
msgstr "非线性优化方案的特殊参数。仅供专家使用！"

msgid "Old form (obsolete):"
msgstr "旧格式（已废弃）："

msgid ""
"Special parameters for DIIS convergence acceleration. For experts only!"
msgstr "用于 DIIS 收敛加速的特殊参数。仅供专家使用！"

msgid "Saving wavefunction information for CASVB"
msgstr "为 CASVB 保存波函数信息"

msgid ""
"For users of the valence bond program *CASVB*, all wavefunction information "
"that may subsequently be required is saved to the record *vbdump*. The "
"default is not to write this information. If the keyword is specified "
"without a value for *vbdump*, then record 4299.2 is used. This keyword is "
"not needed prior to variational *CASVB* calculations."
msgstr ""
"对于价键程序 *CASVB* 的用户，所有后续可能需要的波函数信息都将保存到记录 *vbdump* 中。默认不写入此信息。如果指定该关键字时未提供 "
"*vbdump* 的值，则使用记录 4299.2。在进行变分 *CASVB* 计算之前不需要此关键字。"

msgid "Saving transformed integrals"
msgstr "保存变换积分"

msgid ""
"*trnint* specifies the record name for integrals in the basis of active "
"CASSCF MOs. These are used for example by *CASVB* (see section `recovering "
"CASSCF CI vector and VB wavefunction <the_vb_program_casvb.html#recovering-"
"casscf-ci-vector-and-vb-wavefunction>`__). The default value for *trnint* is"
" 1900.1."
msgstr ""
"*trnint* 指定了在活性 CASSCF 分子轨道基组下积分的记录名称。这些积分例如被 *CASVB* 使用（参见章节 `recovering "
"CASSCF CI vector and VB wavefunction <the_vb_program_casvb.html#recovering-"
"casscf-ci-vector-and-vb-wavefunction>`__\\ ）。\\ *trnint* 的默认值为 1900.1。"

msgid "CAHF optimization with the MCSCF program"
msgstr "使用 MCSCF 程序进行 CAHF 优化"

msgid ""
"The configuration-averaged Hartree-Fock (CAHF) optimization is equivalent to"
" a state-averaged optimization averaging over all possible irreducible "
"representations and spin-manifolds. In this case, the density can be "
"evaluated analytically, and a CI optimization is not needed. More details on"
" the CAHF optimization can be found in the `Hartree-Fock program "
"<the_scf_program.html#configuration-averaged-hartree-fock-cahf-or-df-"
"cahf>`__."
msgstr ""
"组态平均 Hartree-Fock (CAHF) "
"优化等价于对所有可能的不可约表示和自旋多重度进行态平均的优化。在这种情况下，密度可以解析地计算，因此不需要进行 CI 优化。关于 CAHF "
"优化的更多细节可以在 `Hartree-Fock 程序 <the_scf_program.html#configuration-"
"averagedhartree-fockcahfordf-cahf>`__ 中找到。"

msgid "The CAHF optimization with multi is activated by the following option:"
msgstr "使用 multi 进行 CAHF 优化通过以下选项激活："

msgid ""
"This option works for all implemented first- and second-order optimization "
"methods, except the Super-CI method. Note that the final canonical orbitals "
"vary from the HF ones, since a different Fock matrix is diagonalized."
msgstr ""
"此选项适用于所有已实现的一阶和二阶优化方法，但 Super-CI 方法除外。请注意，最终的正则轨道与 HF 轨道不同，因为对角化的是不同的 Fock "
"矩阵。"

msgid "Each CAHF shells is set by the following directive"
msgstr "每个 CAHF 壳层通过以下指令设置"

msgid ""
"where nel is the number of electrons in the active shell and the orbital "
"list is given in the form number1.sym1,number2.sym2,... . A range of "
"orbitals in the same symmetry can be given as number1.sym,-number2.sym, "
"which means from number1 to number2. All CAHF orbitals have to be active "
"orbitals, otherwise an error is thrown. If no CAHF directive is given, all "
"active orbitals and electrons are considered in a single CAHF shell."
msgstr ""
"其中 nel 是活性壳层中的电子数，轨道列表以 number1.sym1,number2.sym2,… 的形式给出。同一对称性中的轨道范围可以表示为 "
"number1.sym,-number2.sym，这意味着从 number1 到 number2。所有 CAHF "
"轨道必须是活性轨道，否则会抛出错误。如果未给出 CAHF 指令，则所有活性轨道和电子被视为处于单个 CAHF 壳层中。"

msgid ""
"The CI optimization is entirely skipped in the CAHF optimization, since it "
"likely involves a massive number of states. A subsequent CI optimization "
"based on the WF cards in the input can be turned on by the option "
"{``MULTI``,\\ ``CAHF``,\\ ``CAHF_DO_CI``;...} or by running a CAS-CI "
"optimization with the resulting orbitals (see `CAS-CI optimization "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cas-ci>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在 CAHF 优化中，CI 优化被完全跳过，因为它可能涉及大量的态。基于输入中 WF 卡片的后续 CI 优化可以通过选项 {``MULTI``,\\ "
"``CAHF``,\\ ``CAHF_DO_CI``;…} 开启，或者通过使用所得轨道运行 CAS-CI 优化来开启（参见 `CAS-CI 优化 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cas-ci>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "RHF optimization with the MCSCF program"
msgstr "使用 MCSCF 程序进行 RHF 优化"

msgid ""
"It can be helpful to use the multi program for a restricted-open shell "
"Hartree-Fock (RHF) optimization, since it often provides a more robust "
"optimization than the Hartree-Fock program. This is possible for all first- "
"and second-order methods by the option:"
msgstr ""
"使用 multi 程序进行限制性开壳层 Hartree-Fock (RHF) 优化可能很有帮助，因为它通常提供比 Hartree-Fock "
"程序更稳健的优化。这可以通过以下选项在所有一阶和二阶方法中实现："

msgid ""
"After the optimization, the final orbitals are always calculated as "
"canonical orbitals reproducing the orbitals from the Hartree-Fock program. "
"(Note that the usual MCSCF pseudo canonical orbitals are not exactly the "
"same as the HF ones). Also, the final orbitals can be used in subsequent "
"single-reference programs. The closed, occ and wf cards have to be set "
"accordingly such that the MCSCF wavefunction contains only the open-shell "
"determinant, otherwise, a error is thrown. However, this feature has not "
"been heavily tested for all possible combinations of single-reference tools!"
" Please submit a bug report if crashes or errors appear."
msgstr ""
"优化后，最终轨道总是计算为再现 Hartree-Fock 程序轨道的正则轨道。（请注意，通常的 MCSCF 伪正则轨道与 HF "
"轨道不完全相同）。此外，最终轨道可用于后续的单参考程序。必须相应地设置 closed、occ 和 wf 卡片，使得 MCSCF "
"波函数仅包含开壳层行列式，否则会抛出错误。然而，此功能尚未针对所有可能的单参考工具组合进行大量测试！如果出现崩溃或错误，请提交错误报告。"

msgid "Calculating expectation values"
msgstr "计算期望值"

msgid ""
"By default, the program calculates the dipole expectation and transition "
"moments. Further expectation values or transition properties can be computed"
" using the ``TRAN, TRAN2`` and ``EXPEC, EXPEC2`` directives. The orbitals "
"used for the calculation of the expectation values can be displayed using "
"the `RAWORB <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#raw-orbitals>`__ directive."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，程序会计算偶极期望值和跃迁矩。可以使用 ``TRAN, TRAN2`` 和 ``EXPEC, EXPEC2`` "
"指令计算进一步的期望值或跃迁性质。用于计算期望值的轨道可以通过 `RAWORB "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#raworbitals>`__ 指令显示。"

msgid "Matrix elements over one-electron operators"
msgstr "单电子算符的矩阵元"

msgid ""
"Calculate expectation values and transition matrix elements for the given "
"one-electron operators. The [*state*] command is optional, and can be used "
"to specify the states for which the matrix elements are calculated (see "
"below). With ``EXPEC`` only expectation values are calculated. "
":math:`oper_i` is a codeword for the operator. The available operators and "
"their associated keywords are given in section `One-electron operators and "
"expectation values (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-"
"and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__. Only non-zero values are printed, unless "
"the (optional) command *print_zero* is given!"
msgstr ""
"计算给定单电子算符的期望值和跃迁矩阵元。[*state*] 命令是可选的，可用于指定计算矩阵元所针对的态（见下文）。使用 ``EXPEC`` "
"时仅计算期望值。\\ :math:`oper_i` 是算符的代码字。可用的算符及其关联的关键字在章节 `单电子算符和期望值 (GEXPEC) "
"<program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-values-"
"gexpec>`__ 中给出。除非给出（可选的）命令 *print_zero*\\ ，否则仅打印非零值！"

msgid ""
"Since Molpro 2021, only the transition matrix elements with the ground state"
" are calculated as the default. It is possible to specify the states used in"
" the calculation by the following options for [*state*]:"
msgstr "自 Molpro 2021 起，默认仅计算与基态的跃迁矩阵元。可以通过以下 [*state*] 选项指定计算中使用的态："

msgid ""
"``ground``: Only calculate the matrix elements including the ground state "
"(default for ``TRAN``)."
msgstr "``ground``\\ ：仅计算包含基态的矩阵元（\\ ``TRAN`` 的默认值）。"

msgid "``all``: Calculate all matrix elements (default for ``EXPEC``)."
msgstr "``all``\\ ：计算所有矩阵元（\\ ``EXPEC`` 的默认值）。"

msgid "``none``: Skip the matrix elements for the given operators."
msgstr "``none``\\ ：跳过给定算符的矩阵元计算。"

msgid "Matrix elements over two-electron operators"
msgstr "双电子算符的矩阵元"

msgid ""
"Calculate transition matrix elements for two-electron operators. This is "
"presently only useful for angular momentum operators. With ``EXPEC2`` only "
"diagonal matrix elements will be computed."
msgstr "计算双电子算符的跃迁矩阵元。目前这仅对角动量算符有用。使用 ``EXPEC2`` 时，仅计算对角矩阵元。"

msgid "For instance"
msgstr "例如"

msgid "``TRAN2,LXX`` calculates matrix elements for :math:`L_x^2`"
msgstr "``TRAN2,LXX`` 计算 :math:`L_x^2` 的矩阵元"

msgid "``TRAN2,LYY`` calculates matrix elements for :math:`L_y^2`"
msgstr "``TRAN2,LYY`` 计算 :math:`L_y^2` 的矩阵元"

msgid ""
"``TRAN2,LXZ`` calculates matrix elements for "
":math:`\\frac{1}{2}(L_xL_z+L_zL_x)`"
msgstr "``TRAN2,LXZ`` 计算 :math:`\\frac{1}{2}(L_xL_z+L_zL_x)` 的矩阵元"

msgid ""
"``TRAN2,LXX,LYY,LZZ`` calculates matrix elements for :math:`L_x^2`, "
":math:`L_y^2`, and :math:`L_z^2`. The matrix elements for the sum "
":math:`L^2` are also printed."
msgstr ""
"``TRAN2,LXX,LYY,LZZ`` 计算 :math:`L_x^2`\\ 、\\ :math:`L_y^2` 和 :math:`L_z^2` "
"的矩阵元。总和 :math:`L^2` 的矩阵元也会被打印出来。"

msgid ""
"Only the non-zero values are printed for transition elements, while all "
"values are printed for the expectation values. The zero values of the "
"transition elements can be optionally printed by adding the command "
"*print_zero* as for the one-electron operator matrix elements."
msgstr ""
"对于跃迁元，仅打印非零值，而对于期望值，则打印所有值。跃迁元的零值可以通过添加命令 *print_zero* "
"来选择性打印，如同处理单电子算符矩阵元一样。"

msgid "The special two-electron operator MPOL, i.e."
msgstr "特殊的双电子算符 MPOL，即"

msgid "``EXPEC2,MPOL``"
msgstr "``EXPEC2,MPOL``"

msgid "``TRAN2,MPOL``"
msgstr "``TRAN2,MPOL``"

msgid "Saving the density matrix"
msgstr "保存密度矩阵"

msgid ""
"If the ``DM`` directive is given, the first order density matrix in AO basis"
" is written to the dump record specified on the ``ORBITAL`` card (default "
"2140.2). If no ``ORBITAL`` card is present, but a record is specified on a "
"``NATORB``, ``CANORB``, or ``LOCORB`` card, the densities are saved to the "
"first record occurring in the input. In a state-averaged calculation the SA-"
"density, as well the individual state densities, are saved. See section "
"`selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ for information about how to recover any of these "
"densities for use in later programs."
msgstr ""
"如果给出 ``DM`` 指令，一阶密度矩阵（以原子轨道基组表示）将被写入 ``ORBITAL`` 卡片指定的转储记录（默认为 2140.2）。如果不存在"
" ``ORBITAL`` 卡片，但在 ``NATORB``\\ 、\\ ``CANORB`` 或 ``LOCORB`` "
"卡片上指定了记录，则密度将保存到输入中出现的第一个记录。在态平均计算中，SA "
"密度以及各个态的密度都会被保存。有关如何恢复这些密度以供后续程序使用的信息，请参阅章节 `selecting orbitals and density "
"matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-"
"orbitals-and-density-matrices-orbital-density>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"If *spindens* is a number greater than zero, the spin density matrices are "
"also saved. Note that a maximum of 50 density matrices can be saved in one "
"dump record."
msgstr "如果 *spindens* 是一个大于零的数字，自旋密度矩阵也会被保存。请注意，一个转储记录中最多可以保存 50 个密度矩阵。"

msgid ""
"If no ``DM`` directive is given), the first order density matrix is saved in"
" single-state calculations, and only the stage-averaged density matrix in "
"state-averaged calculations."
msgstr "如果未给出 ``DM`` 指令），在单态计算中会保存一阶密度矩阵，而在态平均计算中仅保存态平均密度矩阵。"

msgid "Coupled-perturbed MCSCF"
msgstr "耦合微扰 MCSCF"

msgid ""
"The coupled-perturbed (CP) MCSCF is required for computing gradients with "
"state-averaged orbitals, non-adiabatic couplings, difference gradients or "
"polarizabilities. The CP-MCSCF program has been reimplemented in Molpro 2020"
" to improve robustness and performance"
msgstr ""
"耦合微扰 (CP) MCSCF 是计算使用态平均轨道的梯度、非绝热耦合、差分梯度或极化率所必需的。CP-MCSCF 程序已在 Molpro 2020 "
"中重新实现，以提高鲁棒性和性能。"

msgid "The following options are available in the CP-MCSCF program:"
msgstr "CP-MCSCF 程序中提供以下选项："

msgid ""
"``CP_MCSCF_OLD`` Activates the old implementation of Molpro 2019 and earlier"
" (default: 0)."
msgstr "``CP_MCSCF_OLD`` 激活 Molpro 2019 及更早版本的旧实现（默认值：0）。"

msgid ""
"``CP_MCSCF_VERBOSITY`` Verbosity of the CP-MCSCF program. Subspace "
"iterations can be printed with CP_MCSCF_VERBOSITY=2 (default: 1)."
msgstr ""
"``CP_MCSCF_VERBOSITY`` CP-MCSCF 程序的详细程度。子空间迭代可通过 CP_MCSCF_VERBOSITY=2 "
"打印（默认值：1）。"

msgid ""
"``CP_MCSCF_MAXIT`` Maximal number of iterations of the iterative subspace "
"solver for the z-equation (default: 100)."
msgstr "``CP_MCSCF_MAXIT`` z 方程迭代子空间求解器的最大迭代次数（默认值：100）。"

msgid ""
"``CP_MCSCF_ALL_RHS`` 0: z-equation is solved for each RHS separately, 1: the"
" z-equation is solved for all RHS together, 2: automatic decision (default: "
"2)."
msgstr ""
"``CP_MCSCF_ALL_RHS`` 0：为每个 RHS 单独求解 z 方程，1：为所有 RHS 一起求解 z 方程，2：自动决定（默认值：2）。"

msgid "Gradients for SA-MCSCF"
msgstr "SA-MCSCF 的梯度"

msgid "For computing state-averaged gradients, use"
msgstr "要计算态平均梯度，请使用"

msgid ""
"The gradients are computed by a subsequent call to ``FORCES`` or ``OPTG`` "
"(see Section `State-averaged MCSCF gradients with Cadpac "
"<energy_gradients.html#state-averaged-mcscf-gradients-with-cadpac>`__)"
msgstr ""
"梯度通过后续调用 ``FORCES`` 或 ``OPTG`` 来计算（参见章节 `State-averaged MCSCF gradients with"
" Cadpac <energy_gradients.html#state-averaged-mcscf-gradients-with-"
"cadpac>`__\\ ）"

msgid ""
"Note: if for some reason the gradients are to be computed numerically from "
"finite energy differences, it is in state-averaged calculations necessary to"
" give, instead of the ``CPMCSCF`` input, the following:"
msgstr "注意：如果由于某种原因需要通过有限能量差分数值计算梯度，则在态平均计算中，必须给出以下输入，而不是 ``CPMCSCF`` 输入："

msgid "``SAVE,GRAD=-1``"
msgstr "``SAVE,GRAD=-1``"

msgid "Otherwise the program will stop with an error message."
msgstr "否则程序将停止并显示错误信息。"

msgid "Difference gradients for SA-MCSCF"
msgstr "SA-MCSCF 的差分梯度"

msgid "For computing difference gradients, use"
msgstr "要计算差分梯度，请使用"

msgid ""
"where *state1* and *state2* specify the two states considered. (e.g., "
"2.1,3.1 for the second and third states in symmetry 1) The gradient of the "
"energy difference will be computed. Both states must have the same symmetry."
" *record* specifies a record on which the gradient information is stored "
"(the default is 5101.1). *thresh* is a threshold for the accuracy of the CP-"
"MCSCF solution. The default is 1.d-7."
msgstr ""
"其中 *state1* 和 *state2* 指定所考虑的两个态。（例如，2.1,3.1 表示对称性 1 "
"中的第二和第三态）将计算能量差的梯度。两个态必须具有相同的对称性。\\ *record* 指定存储梯度信息的记录（默认为 5101.1）。\\ "
"*thresh* 是 CP-MCSCF 解精度的阈值。默认值为 1.d-7。"

msgid ""
"The gradients are computed by a subsequent call to ``FORCES`` or ``OPTG``. "
"(see Section `State-averaged MCSCF gradients with Cadpac "
"<energy_gradients.html#state-averaged-mcscf-gradients-with-cadpac>`__)"
msgstr ""
"梯度通过后续调用 ``FORCES`` 或 ``OPTG`` 来计算（参见章节 `State-averaged MCSCF gradients with"
" Cadpac <energy_gradients.html#state-averaged-mcscf-gradients-with-"
"cadpac>`__\\ ）"

msgid "Non-adiabatic coupling matrix elements for SA-MCSCF"
msgstr "SA-MCSCF 的非绝热耦合矩阵元"

msgid "For computing non-adiabatic coupling matrix elements analytically, use"
msgstr "要解析计算非绝热耦合矩阵元，请使用"

msgid ""
"where *state1* and *state2* specify the two states considered. (e.g., "
"2.1,3.1 for the second and third states in symmetry 1) Both states must have"
" the same symmetry. *record* specifies a record on which the gradient "
"information is stored (the default is 5101.1). This will be read in the "
"subsequent gradient calculation. *thresh* is a threshold for the accuracy of"
" the CP-MCSCF solution. The default is 1.d-7."
msgstr ""
"其中 *state1* 和 *state2* 指定所考虑的两个态。（例如，2.1,3.1 表示对称性 1 "
"中的第二和第三态）两个态必须具有相同的对称性。\\ *record* 指定存储梯度信息的记录（默认为 5101.1）。这将在后续的梯度计算中被读取。\\"
" *thresh* 是 CP-MCSCF 解精度的阈值。默认值为 1.d-7。"

msgid ""
"``NADC`` and ``NADK`` are an aliases for ``NADC``, and ``SAVE`` is an alias "
"for ``RECORD``."
msgstr "``NADC`` 和 ``NADK`` 是 ``NADC`` 的别名，\\ ``SAVE`` 是 ``RECORD`` 的别名。"

msgid ""
"The matrix elements for each atom are computed by a subsequent call to "
"``FORCES`` (see Section `State-averaged MCSCF gradients with Cadpac "
"<energy_gradients.html#state-averaged-mcscf-gradients-with-cadpac>`__)."
msgstr ""
"每个原子的矩阵元通过后续调用 ``FORCES`` 来计算（参见章节 `State-averaged MCSCF gradients with "
"Cadpac <energy_gradients.html#state-averaged-mcscf-gradients-with-"
"cadpac>`__\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"Note: this program is not yet extensively tested and should be used with "
"care!"
msgstr "注意：此程序尚未经过广泛测试，使用时请谨慎！"

msgid "MCSCF hessians"
msgstr "MCSCF Hessian 矩阵"

msgid ""
"The MCSCF/CASSCF hessian can be computed analytically (only without "
"symmetry) using"
msgstr "MCSCF/CASSCF Hessian 矩阵可以解析计算（仅在没有对称性时）使用"

msgid ""
"where the ``ACCU`` option specifies the convergence threshold in the CPMCSCF"
" calculation (default 1.d-4). The hessian is stored on record 5300.2 and can"
" be used in a subsequent frequency calculation."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``ACCU`` 选项指定了 CPMCSCF 计算中的收敛阈值（默认值为 1.d-4）。Hessian 矩阵存储在记录 5300.2 "
"上，可用于后续的频率计算。"

msgid "Note that the ``NOEXTRA`` option is used when computing a hessian."
msgstr "注意，计算 Hessian 矩阵时使用了 ``NOEXTRA`` 选项。"

msgid "Optimizing valence bond wavefunctions"
msgstr "优化价键波函数"

msgid "``VB={…}``"
msgstr "``VB={…}``"

msgid "Total Position-Spread tensor (TPS)"
msgstr "总位置展宽张量 (TPS)"

msgid "The program is invoked by ``TRAN2`` inside the ``MULTI`` input block:"
msgstr "该程序通过在 ``MULTI`` 输入块中使用 ``TRAN2`` 来调用："

msgid "``TRAN2,RXX,RYY,RZZ,RXY,RXZ,RYZ;``"
msgstr "``TRAN2,RXX,RYY,RZZ,RXY,RXZ,RYZ;``"

msgid ""
"The three different classes of contributions to the CASSCF wave function can"
" be printed by using the keyword:"
msgstr "可以通过使用以下关键词打印对CASSCF波函数的三种不同类别贡献："

msgid "``IPRINT,TPS1;``"
msgstr "``IPRINT,TPS1;``"

msgid ""
"This will print the core-core, core-active, and active-active contributions "
"of the TPS tensor are printed."
msgstr "这将打印TPS张量的核-核、核-活性以及活性-活性贡献。"

msgid "Hints and strategies"
msgstr "提示与策略"

msgid ""
"MCSCF is not a “black box” procedure like SCF! For simple cases, for example"
" a simple CASSCF with no ``CLOSED`` orbitals, this program will converge in "
"two or three iterations. For more complicated cases, you may have more "
"trouble. In that case, consider the following:"
msgstr ""
"MCSCF不像SCF那样是一个“黑箱”过程！对于简单情况，例如没有\\ ``CLOSED``\\ "
"轨道的简单CASSCF，该程序将在两到三次迭代中收敛。对于更复杂的情况，您可能会遇到更多麻烦。在这种情况下，请考虑以下建议："

msgid ""
"Always start from neighbouring geometry orbitals when available (this is the"
" default)."
msgstr "当有相邻几何结构的轨道可用时，始终从它们开始（这是默认设置）。"

msgid ""
"The convergence algorithm is more stable when there are no ``CLOSED`` "
"orbitals, i.e., orbitals doubly occupied in all configurations, but fully "
"optimized. Thus a reasonable approach is to make an initial calculation with"
" ``CLOSED`` replaced by ``FROZEN`` (all doubly occ. frozen)."
msgstr ""
"当没有\\ ``CLOSED``\\ 轨道（即在所有构型中双占据但完全优化的轨道）时，收敛算法更加稳定。因此，一种合理的方法是先用\\ "
"``FROZEN``\\ 替换\\ ``CLOSED``\\ （所有双占据轨道被冻结）进行初始计算。"

msgid ""
"You can often get a clue about where the program starts to diverge if you "
"include:"
msgstr "若在数据中包含以下内容，通常可以获知程序从何处开始发散："

msgid "``IPRINT,MICRO;``"
msgstr "``IPRINT,MICRO;``"

msgid ""
"in the data. Also consider the general remarks at the beginning of this "
"chapter. For the details of the algorithms used, see J. Chem. Phys 82, 5053 "
"(1985); `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(85)80025-7>`__ **115**, 259 (1985); "
"Advan. Chem. Phys. 59, 1 (1987);"
msgstr ""
"在数据中。同时请参考本章开头的总体说明。所用算法的详细信息，请参阅 J. Chem. Phys 82, 5053 (1985); `Chem. "
"Phys. Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(85)80025-7>`__ **115**, "
"259 (1985); Advan. Chem. Phys. 59, 1 (1987);"

