"The program is invoked by the command ``MULTI``, ``MCSCF``, ``CASSCF``, or "
"``CASCI``. The commands can be prepended by 'DF-' to use density fitting, "
"which is strongly recommended for larger molecules."
msgstr ""
"该程序通过命令 ``MULTI``\\ 、\\ ``MCSCF``\\ 、\\ ``CASSCF`` 或 ``CASCI`` "
"调用。可在命令前加上“DF-”以使用密度拟合，对于较大的分子强烈推荐使用。"

msgid "``OCC,$n_1,n_2,...,n_8$;``"
msgstr "``OCC,$n_1,n_2,...,n_8$;``"

msgid "``FROZEN,$n_1,n_2,\\ldots,$record.file,type;``"
msgstr "``FROZEN,$n_1,n_2,\\ldots,$record.file,type;``"

msgid "``CLOSED,$n_1,n_2,\\ldots,n_8$``"
msgstr "``CLOSED,$n_1,n_2,\\ldots,n_8$``"

msgid ""
":math:`n_i` is the number of closed-shell orbitals in irrep number "
":math:`i`, inclusive of any ``FROZEN`` orbitals. These orbitals do not form "
"part of the active space, i.e., they are doubly occupied in all CSFs. In "
"contrast to the core orbitals (see ``FROZEN``), these orbitals are fully "
"optimized."
msgstr ""
":math:`n_i` 是第 :math:`i` 个不可约表示中的闭壳层轨道数，包括任何 ``FROZEN`` "
"轨道。这些轨道不构成活性空间的一部分，即在所有 CSF 中均为双占据。与芯轨道（见 ``FROZEN``\\ ）不同，这些轨道会被完全优化。"

msgid "``FREEZE,orb.sym;``"
msgstr "``FREEZE,orb.sym;``"

msgid "``WF,elec,sym,spin``"
msgstr "``WF,elec,sym,spin``"

msgid "***elec*** is the number of electrons"
msgstr "***elec*** 是电子数"

msgid "***sym*** is the number of the irreducible representation"
msgstr "***sym*** 是不可约表示的编号"

msgid ""
"***spin*** defines the spin symmetry, *spin*\\ :math:`=2S` (singlet=0, "
"doublet=1, triplet=2, etc.)"
msgstr "***spin*** 定义自旋对称性，*\\ spin*\\ :math:`=2S`\\ （单重态=0，双重态=1，三重态=2，等等）"

msgid "``STATE,nstate;``"
msgstr "``STATE,nstate;``"

msgid "``WEIGHT,$w(1),w(2),\\ldots, w($nstate$)$;``"
msgstr "``WEIGHT,$w(1),w(2),\\ldots, w($nstate$)$;``"

msgid "``DYNW,dynfac``"
msgstr "``DYNW,dynfac``"

msgid "``DYNW,dynfac,STATES=[MS2=spin,SYM=sym,STATE=x-y]``"
msgstr "``DYNW,dynfac,STATES=[MS2=spin,SYM=sym,STATE=x-y]``"

msgid ""
"The states in the weighting are given by the criterion in the square "
"bracket. It is also possible to select all symmetries, spins, and states by "
"a star, e.g. SYM=\\*. Furthermore the brackets can be combined to set up "
"multiple criteria, as shown in the example below. During the dynamically "
"weighting, only the weights of the selected states are adjusted while the "
"weights of the other states are set to 1.0 before the normalization. The "
"energy minimum for :math:`\\Delta E` is determined within the dynamically "
"weighted states. If no states are specified in the input, all states are "
"included in the dynamically weighting."
msgstr ""
"权重中的态由方括号中的条件给出。也可以通过星号选择所有对称性、自旋和态，例如 "
"SYM=\\*。此外，方括号可以组合以建立多个条件，如下例所示。在动态加权过程中，只调整所选态的权重，而其他态的权重在归一化之前设为 1.0。\\ "
":math:`\\Delta E` 的能量最小值在动态加权的态中确定。如果输入中未指定态，则所有态都包含在动态加权中。"

msgid "examples/h2o_dynw_states.inp"
msgstr "examples/h2o_dynw_states.inp"

msgid ""
"By default, the program generates a complete configuration set (CAS) in the "
"active space. The full space may be restricted to a certain occupation "
"pattern using the ``RESTRICT`` option. Alternatively, configurations may be "
"selected from the wavefunction of a previous calculation using ``SELECT``, "
"or explicitly specified on ``CON`` cards. Note that this program only allows"
" to select or specify orbital configurations. For each orbital "
"configuration, all spin couplings are always included. Possible ``RESTRICT, "
"SELECT`` and ``CON`` cards must immediately follow the ``WF`` card which "
"defines the corresponding state symmetry."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，程序在活性空间中生成完整的组态集（CAS）。可以使用 ``RESTRICT`` 选项将全空间限制为特定的占据模式。或者，可以使用 "
"``SELECT`` 从前一次计算的波函数中选择组态，或在 ``CON`` "
"卡上显式指定组态。注意，该程序只允许选择或指定轨道组态。对于每个轨道组态，始终包含所有自旋耦合。可能的 ``RESTRICT``\\ 、\\ "
"``SELECT`` 和 ``CON`` 卡必须紧跟在定义相应态对称性的 ``WF`` 卡之后。"

msgid "``RESTRICT,nmin,nmax,orb$_1$,orb$_2$,$\\ldots$orb$_n$;``"
msgstr "``RESTRICT,nmin,nmax,orb$_1$,orb$_2$,$\\ldots$orb$_n$;``"

msgid "``SELECT,ref1,ref2,refthr,refstat,mxshrf;``"
msgstr "``SELECT,ref1,ref2,refthr,refstat,mxshrf;``"

msgid ""
"***ref1=rec1.file*** (*rec1:math:`>2000`*) The configurations are read in "
"from the specified record. If *ref1* is not specified, the program assumes "
"that the configurations are read from subsequent CON cards (see CON)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"***ref2=rec2.file*** (*rec2:math:`>2000`*) Additional configurations are "
"read from the specified record. If *rec2* is negative, all records between  "
"*rec1* and abs(*rec2*) are read. All configurations found in this way are "
"merged."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"***refthr*** Selection threshold for configurations read from disc (records"
"  *rec1–rec2*). This applies to the norm of all CSFs for each orbital "
"configuration."
msgstr "***refthr*** 从磁盘读取的组态（记录 *\\ rec1–rec2*）的选择阈值。这适用于每个轨道组态的所有 CSF 的范数。"

msgid ""
"***refstat*** Specifies from which state vector the configurations are "
"selected. This only applies to the case that the configurations were saved "
"in a state-averaged calculation. If *refstat* is not specified, the "
"configurations are selected from all states."
msgstr ""
"***refstat*** 指定从哪个态矢量选择组态。这仅适用于组态保存在态平均计算中的情况。如果未指定 *\\ "
"refstat*，则从所有态中选择组态。"

msgid ""
"***mxshrf*** max. number of open shells in the selected or generated "
"configurations."
msgstr "***mxshrf*** 所选或生成的组态中开壳层的最大数量。"

msgid "``CON,$n_1,n_2,n_3,n_4,\\ldots$``"
msgstr "``CON,$n_1,n_2,n_3,n_4,\\ldots$``"

msgid ""
"Specifies an orbital configuration to be included in the present symmetry. "
"The first ``CON`` card must be preceded by a ``SELECT`` card. :math:`n_1`, "
":math:`n_2` etc. are the occupation numbers of the active orbitals (0,1,or "
"2). For example, for ``OCC,5,2,2;CLOSED,2,1,1;\\\\`` :math:`n_1` is the "
"occupation of orbital 3.1 (number.sym), :math:`n_2` is the occupation of "
"orbital 4.1, :math:`n_3` of 5.1, :math:`n_4` of 2.2, and :math:`n_5` of 2.3 "
"Any number of ``CON`` cards may follow each other."
msgstr ""
"指定要包含在当前对称性中的轨道组态。第一张 ``CON`` 卡之前必须有一张 ``SELECT`` 卡。\\ :math:`n_1`\\ 、\\ "
":math:`n_2` 等是活性轨道的占据数（0、1 或 2）。例如，对于 ``OCC,5,2,2;CLOSED,2,1,1;\\\\``\\ ，\\ "
":math:`n_1` 是轨道 3.1（编号.对称性）的占据数，\\ :math:`n_2` 是轨道 4.1 的占据数，\\ :math:`n_3` 是"
" 5.1 的占据数，\\ :math:`n_4` 是 2.2 的占据数，\\ :math:`n_5` 是 2.3 的占据数。任意数量的 ``CON`` "
"卡可以连续出现。"

msgid "``PSPACE,thresh``"
msgstr "``PSPACE,thresh``"

msgid ""
"Since Molpro can only use Abelian point groups (e.g. :math:`C_{2v}` instead "
"of :math:`C_{\\infty v}` for linear molecules), :math:`\\Delta_{x^2-y^2}` "
"states as well as :math:`\\Sigma^+` states occur in the irreducible "
"representation number 1, for example. Sometimes it is not possible to "
"predict in advance to which state(s) the program will converge. In such "
"cases the ``LQUANT`` option can be used to specify which states are desired."
msgstr ""
"由于 Molpro 只能使用 Abelian 点群（例如对线性分子使用 :math:`C_{2v}` 而非 :math:`C_{\\infty "
"v}`\\ ），因此 :math:`\\Delta_{x^2-y^2}` 态以及 :math:`\\Sigma^+` 态会出现在编号为 1 "
"的不可约表示中。有时无法预先预测程序将收敛到哪个（些）态。在这种情况下，可以使用 ``LQUANT`` 选项来指定所需的态。"

msgid "``LQUANT,lam(1),lam(2),$\\ldots$,lam(nstate);``"
msgstr "``LQUANT,lam(1),lam(2),$\\ldots$,lam(nstate);``"

msgid "``START,record,[options];``"
msgstr "``START,record,[options];``"

msgid "``CIGUESS,record.file``"
msgstr "``CIGUESS,record.file``"

msgid "``ROTATE,orb1.sym,orb2.sym,angle``"
msgstr "``ROTATE,orb1.sym,orb2.sym,angle``"

msgid "``ORBITAL,record.file``"
msgstr "``ORBITAL,record.file``"

msgid "``NATORB,[record,] [options]``"
msgstr "``NATORB,[record,] [options]``"

msgid ""
"**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *nvirt*** Request to print *nvirt* virtual orbitals in "
"each symmetry. By default, the orbitals are not printed unless the "
"``ORBPRINT`` option (see section `print options "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#print-options>`__ is present or the global "
"``GPRINT,ORBITALS`` (see section `global Print Options (GPRINT/NOGPRINT) "
"<program_control.html#global-print-options-gprint-nogprint>`__) directive "
"has been given before. The ``PRINT`` option on this card applies only to the"
" current orbitals."
msgstr ""
"**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ nvirt*** 请求在每个对称性中打印 *\\ nvirt* 个虚轨道。默认情况下，除非存在 "
"``ORBPRINT`` 选项（参见 `打印选项 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#print-options>`__ "
"一节）或之前已给出全局 ``GPRINT,ORBITALS`` 指令（参见 `全局打印选项（GPRINT/NOGPRINT） "
"<program_control.html#global-print-options-gprint-nogprint>`__ "
"一节），否则不打印轨道。此卡片上的 ``PRINT`` 选项仅适用于当前轨道。"

msgid ""
"**``CIREC``\\ =\\ *record*** or **``SAVE``\\ =\\ *record*** Save the "
"civector(s) to the specified record. The CI vectors are automatically stored"
" in CSF basis, for more details see `saving the CI vector "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors>`__. Other aliases for "
"``CIREC``  are ``CIREF`` and ``CIVEC``."
msgstr ""
"**``CIREC``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 或 **\\ ``SAVE``\\ =\\ *record*** 将 CI "
"向量保存到指定的记录。CI 向量自动以 CSF 基存储，更多细节参见 `保存 CI 向量 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors>`__\\ 。\\ ``CIREC`` "
"的其他别名是 ``CIREF`` 和 ``CIVEC``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``DETCIREC``\\ =\\ *record*** Export of the CI vector in determinant basis"
" for multi restarts (more details `here "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#export-the-ci-vectors-in-determinant-"
"form>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**``DETCIREC``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 以行列式基导出 CI 向量以用于多次重启（更多细节参见 `此处 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#export-the-ci-vectors-in-determinant-"
"form>`__\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**``ORBITAL``\\ =\\ *record*** Request to save the orbitals to the specified"
" record. This has the same effect as specifying *record* as the first "
"argument (see above)."
msgstr ""
"**``ORBITAL``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 请求将轨道保存到指定的记录。这与将 *\\ record* "
"指定为第一个参数（见上文）效果相同。"

msgid ""
"A simple export of the final orbitals and CI vectors reads "
"\"natorb,2140.2,cirec=5100.2;\"."
msgstr "一个简单的最终轨道和 CI 向量导出示例如下：\"natorb,2140.2,cirec=5100.2;\"。"

msgid ""
"**``STATE``\\ =\\ *state*** Compute natural orbitals for the specified "
"state. *state* has the form *istate.isym*, e.g., 3.2 for the third state in "
"symmetry 2. In contrast to earlier versions, *isym* refers to the number of "
"the irreducible representation, and not the sequence number of the state "
"symmetry. It is therefore independent of the order in which ``WF`` cards are"
" given. The specified state must have been optimized. If ``STATE`` is not "
"given and two or more states are averaged, the natural orbitals are "
"calculated with the state-averaged density matrix (default)."
msgstr ""
"**``STATE``\\ =\\ *\\ state*** 为指定的态计算自然轨道。*\\ state\\ * 的形式为 *\\ "
"istate.isym\\ *，例如 3.2 表示对称性 2 中的第三个态。与早期版本不同，*\\ isym* "
"指的是不可约表示的编号，而不是态对称性的序号。因此它与 ``WF`` 卡片的给出顺序无关。指定的态必须已经优化。如果未给出 ``STATE`` "
"且平均了两个或更多态，则使用态平均密度矩阵计算自然轨道（默认）。"

msgid ""
"**``SPIN``\\ =\\ *ms2*** Compute natural orbitals for states with the "
"specified spin. *ms2* equals :math:`2*S`, i.e., 0 for singlet, 1 for doublet"
" etc. This can be used to together with ``STATE`` to select a specific state"
" in case that states of different spin are averaged. If ``STATE`` is not "
"specified, the state-averaged density for all states of the given spin is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"**``SPIN``\\ =\\ *\\ ms2*** 为具有指定自旋的态计算自然轨道。*\\ ms2\\ * 等于 :math:`2*\\ "
"S`，即单重态为 0，双重态为 1，等等。当不同自旋的态被平均时，这可与 ``STATE`` 一起使用以选择特定的态。如果未指定 ``STATE``\\"
" ，则使用给定自旋所有态的态平均密度。"

msgid "``CANORB,[record,] [options]``"
msgstr "``CANORB,[record,] [options]``"

msgid "``CANONICAL,[record,] [options]``"
msgstr "``CANONICAL,[record,] [options]``"

msgid "``LOCORB,[record,] [options]``"
msgstr "``LOCORB,[record,] [options]``"

msgid "``LOCAL,[record,] [options]``"
msgstr "``LOCAL,[record,] [options]``"

msgid "``RAWORB,[record,] [options]``"
msgstr "``RAWORB,[record,] [options]``"

msgid ""
"This procedure works as follows: first, the orbitals are determined at the "
"reference geometry. Then, the calculations are performed at displaced "
"geometries, and the \"diabatic\" active orbitals, which have maximum overlap"
" with the active orbitals at the reference geometry, are obtained by adding "
"a ``DIAB`` directive to the input:"
msgstr ""
"此过程工作如下：首先，在参考几何构型下确定轨道。然后，在位移的几何构型下执行计算，并通过在输入中添加 ``DIAB`` "
"指令来获得与参考几何构型下的活性轨道具有最大重叠的“透热”活性轨道："

msgid "``Old form (Molpro96, obsolete):``"
msgstr "``旧格式（Molpro96，已过时）：``"

msgid "``DIAB,orbref, orbsav, orb1,orb2,pri``"
msgstr "``DIAB,orbref, orbsav, orb1,orb2,pri``"

msgid ""
"``DIAB,orbref [,TYPE=orbtype] [,STATE=state]  "
"[,SPIN=spin] [,MS2=ms2] [,SAVE=orbsav]  [,PRINT=pri] [,METHOD=method]``"
msgstr ""
"``DIAB,orbref [,TYPE=orbtype] [,STATE=state]  [,SPIN=spin] [,MS2=ms2] "
"[,SAVE=orbsav]  [,PRINT=pri] [,METHOD=method]``"

msgid "``DIAB,orbref``"
msgstr "``DIAB,orbref``"

msgid ""
"The diabatic orbitals have the property that the sum of orbital and overlap "
"contributions in the non-adiabatic coupling matrix elements become "
"approximately zero, such that the adiabatic mixing occurs only through "
"changes of the CI coefficients. This allows to determine the mixing angle "
"directly from the CI coefficients, either in a simple way as described for "
"instance in `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.454971>`__ **89**,"
" 3139 (1988), or in a more advanced manner as described by Pacher, "
"Cederbaum, and Köppel in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.455268>`__ **89**, 7367 (1988). Recently, an "
"automatic procedure, as described in J. Chem. Phys. **102**, 0000, (1999) "
"has been implemented into Molpro. This is available in Version 99.1 and "
"later and is described in section :doc:`quasi-diabatization <quasi-"
"diabatization>`."
msgstr ""
"透热轨道具有这样的性质：非绝热耦合矩阵元中轨道贡献与重叠贡献之和近似为零，从而绝热混合仅通过 CI 系数的变化发生。这使得可以直接从 CI "
"系数确定混合角，既可以采用简单方式（如 `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.454971>`__"
" **89**, 3139 (1988) 中所述），也可以采用更高级的方式（如 Pacher、Cederbaum 和 Köppel 在 `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.455268>`__ **89**, 7367 (1988) "
"中所述）。最近，Molpro 中实现了一种自动过程，如 J. Chem. Phys. **102**, 0000, (1999) 中所述。该功能在 "
"99.1 及更高版本中可用，并在 :doc:`准透热化 <quasi-diabatization>` 一节中描述。"

msgid "examples/h2s_diab.inp"
msgstr "examples/h2s_diab.inp"

msgid ""
"See section :doc:`quasi-diabatization <quasi-diabatization>` for the "
"automatic generation of diabatic energies."
msgstr "关于透热能量的自动生成，参见 :doc:`准透热化 <quasi-diabatization>` 一节。"

msgid "``SAVE,CIREC=record``"
msgstr "``SAVE,CIREC=record``"

msgid ""
"When exporting the CI vectors for the :doc:`spin-orbit-coupling program "
"<spin-orbit-coupling>` please note that the orbitals have to be the same if "
"multiple CI solutions are used in the spin-orbit program. This can be "
"achieved by using the `RAWORB <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#raw-orbitals>`__"
" directive. An example can be found in the `CAHF section "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cahf-optimization-with-the-mcscf-program>`__."
msgstr ""
"当为 :doc:`自旋-轨道耦合程序 <spin-orbit-coupling>` 导出 CI 向量时，请注意如果在自旋-轨道程序中使用多个 CI "
"解，则轨道必须相同。这可以通过使用 `RAWORB <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#raw-orbitals>`__ "
"指令来实现。示例可在 `CAHF 部分 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cahf-optimization-with-"
"the-mcscf-program>`__ 中找到。"

msgid "``SAVE,GRD=grdsav``"
msgstr "``SAVE,GRD=grdsav``"

msgid "``{DF-MULTI,SO-SCI;...}``"
msgstr "``{DF-MULTI,SO-SCI;...}``"

msgid "``{DF-MULTI,SUPER-CI;...}``"
msgstr "``{DF-MULTI,SUPER-CI;...}``"

msgid "``{DF-MULTI,UC-AH;...}``"
msgstr "``{DF-MULTI,UC-AH;...}``"

msgid "``{MULTI,WMK;...}``"
msgstr "``{MULTI,WMK;...}``"

msgid "``{MULTI,WMK_OLD;...}``"
msgstr "``{MULTI,WMK_OLD;...}``"

msgid "``{MULTI,WMK,COUPLED;...}``"
msgstr "``{MULTI,WMK,COUPLED;...}``"

msgid "``{MULTI,HESS_EIG;...}``"
msgstr "``{MULTI,HESS_EIG;...}``"

msgid ""
"``SO_MICRO_FAC`` Factor by which the gradient has to be reduced for "
"convergence of the micro-iterations (default: 0.01). In addition, the square"
" of the starting  gradient (g) is also included, i.e. "
"min(g\\*so_micro_fac,g\\*g)."
msgstr ""
"``SO_MICRO_FAC`` 为使微迭代收敛，梯度须缩减的因子（默认：0.01）。此外，还包含起始梯度（g）的平方，即 "
"min(g\\*so_micro_fac,g\\*\\ g)。"

msgid "``CONFIG,key;``"
msgstr "``CONFIG,key;``"

msgid ""
"Note that state averaging of different spin-states is only possible with "
"Slater determinants, i.e. no ``CONFIG`` or ``SELECT`` must be given in this "
"case."
msgstr "注意，不同自旋态的状态平均只能使用 Slater 行列式，即此时不得给出 ``CONFIG`` 或 ``SELECT``\\ 。"

msgid "``ORBPRINT[,nvirt]``"
msgstr "``ORBPRINT[,nvirt]``"

msgid "``PRINT,key1,key2,$\\ldots$;``"
msgstr "``PRINT,key1,key2,$\\ldots$;``"

msgid "``IPRINT,key1,key2,$\\ldots$;``"
msgstr "``IPRINT,key1,key2,$\\ldots$;``"

msgid "``ACCURACY,[GRADIENT=conv] [,STEP=sconv] [,ENERGY=econv]``"
msgstr "``ACCURACY,[GRADIENT=conv] [,STEP=sconv] [,ENERGY=econv]``"

msgid "***conv*** Threshold for orbital gradient (default: :math:`10^{-5}`)."
msgstr "***conv*** 轨道梯度的阈值（默认：\\ :math:`10^{-5}`\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"***econv*** Threshold for change of total energy (default: :math:`10^{-6}` "
"for second-order and :math:`10^{-8}` for first-order)."
msgstr "***econv*** 总能量变化的阈值（默认：二阶为 :math:`10^{-6}`\\ ，一阶为 :math:`10^{-8}`\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"***sconv*** Threshold for size of step, works only with ``MULTI``,\\ "
"``WMK_OLD`` (default :math:`10^{-3}`)."
msgstr ""
"***sconv*** 步长大小的阈值，仅适用于 ``MULTI``,\\ ``WMK_OLD``\\ （默认：\\ :math:`10^{-3}`\\"
" ）。"

msgid "``MAXITER,maxit;``"
msgstr "``MAXITER,maxit;``"

msgid "``RESTRICT,-1,-1,orbital list``"
msgstr "``RESTRICT,-1,-1,orbital list``"

msgid "``STEP,radius,trust1,tfac1,trust2,tfac2;``"
msgstr "``STEP,radius,trust1,tfac1,trust2,tfac2;``"

msgid "``GOPER,igop;``"
msgstr "``GOPER,igop;``"

msgid "``COPT,ciacc,copvar,maxci,cishft,icimax,icimx1,icimx2,icstrt,icstep;``"
msgstr ""
"``COPT,ciacc,copvar,maxci,cishft,icimax,icimx1,icimx2,icstrt,icstep;``"

msgid "***ciacc*** grad threshold for CI diagonalization"
msgstr "***ciacc*** CI 对角化的梯度阈值"

msgid "***copvar*** start threshold for CI-optimization"
msgstr "***copvar*** CI 优化的起始阈值"

msgid "***maxci*** max. number of CI-optimizations per microiteration"
msgstr "***maxci*** 每次微迭代的最大 CI 优化次数"

msgid "***cishft*** denominator shift for q-space"
msgstr "***cishft*** q 空间的分母位移"

msgid "***icimax*** max. number of CI-optimizations in first macroiteration"
msgstr "***icimax*** 首次宏迭代中的最大 CI 优化次数"

msgid ""
"***icimx1*** max. number of CI-optimizations in second and subsequent "
"iterations"
msgstr "***icimx1*** 第二次及后续迭代中的最大 CI 优化次数"

msgid ""
"***icimx2*** max. number of CI-optimizations in internal absorption step"
msgstr "***icimx2*** 内部吸收步中的最大 CI 优化次数"

msgid "***icstrt*** first microiteration with CI-optimization"
msgstr "***icstrt*** 首次进行 CI 优化的微迭代"

msgid "***icstep*** microiteration increment between CI-optimizations"
msgstr "***icstep*** CI 优化之间的微迭代增量"

msgid "``INTOPT,maxito,maxitc,maxrep,nitrep,iuprod;``"
msgstr "``INTOPT,maxito,maxitc,maxrep,nitrep,iuprod;``"

msgid "``NONLINEAR,itmaxr,ipri,drmax,drdamp,gfak1,gfak2,gfak3,irdamp,ntexp``"
msgstr "``NONLINEAR,itmaxr,ipri,drmax,drdamp,gfak1,gfak2,gfak3,irdamp,ntexp``"

msgid "``THRESH,thrpri,thrpun,varmin,varmax,thrdiv,thrdoub``"
msgstr "``THRESH,thrpri,thrpun,varmin,varmax,thrdiv,thrdoub``"

msgid ""
"``THRESH [,THRPRI=thrpri] [,THRPUN=thrpun] [,VARMIN=varmin] [,THRDIV=thrdiv] [,THRDOUB=thrdoub]``"
msgstr ""
"``THRESH [,THRPRI=thrpri] [,THRPUN=thrpun] [,VARMIN=varmin] [,THRDIV=thrdiv] [,THRDOUB=thrdoub]``"

msgid "***thrpri*** threshold for printing CI coefficients (default 0.04)"
msgstr "***thrpri*** 打印 CI 系数的阈值（默认 0.04）"

msgid ""
"***thrpun*** threshold for writing CI coefficients to the punch file. "
"Default is no write to the punch file"
msgstr "***thrpun*** 将 CI 系数写入 punch 文件的阈值。默认不写入 punch 文件"

msgid ""
"***varmin,varmax*** thresholds for non-linear optimization scheme. For "
"experts only!"
msgstr "***varmin,varmax*** 非线性优化方案的阈值。仅供专家使用！"

msgid ""
"***thrdoub*** threshold for detecting almost doubly occupied orbitals for "
"inclusion into the pseudo canonical set (default 0, i.e. the feature is "
"disabled)."
msgstr "***thrdoub*** 检测几乎双占据轨道以纳入伪正则集的阈值（默认 0，即禁用该功能）。"

msgid "``DIIS,disvar,augvar,maxdis,maxaug,idsci,igwgt,igvec,idstrt,idstep;``"
msgstr "``DIIS,disvar,augvar,maxdis,maxaug,idsci,igwgt,igvec,idstrt,idstep;``"

msgid "``VBDUMP[,vbdump];``"
msgstr "``VBDUMP[,vbdump];``"

msgid "``TRNINT,trnint;``"
msgstr "``TRNINT,trnint;``"

msgid "``{MULTI,CAHF;...}``"
msgstr "``{MULTI,CAHF;...}``"

msgid "examples/cahf_cu2_multi.inp"
msgstr "examples/cahf_cu2_multi.inp"

msgid "``{MULTI,RHF;...}``"
msgstr "``{MULTI,RHF;...}``"

msgid ""
"``EXPEC,[print_zero],$oper_1,oper_2,\\ldots,oper_n$\\\\`` "
"``TRAN,[state],[print_zero],$oper_1,oper_2,\\ldots,oper_n$``"
msgstr ""
"``EXPEC,[print_zero],$oper_1,oper_2,\\ldots,oper_n$\\\\`` "
"``TRAN,[state],[print_zero],$oper_1,oper_2,\\ldots,oper_n$``"

msgid ""
"``state=//state//,MS2=//spin//``: Only calculate the matrix elements "
"including the specified state (e.g. state=2.1,ms2=0 for the first excited "
"singlet state in symmetry 1)."
msgstr ""
"``state=//state//,MS2=//spin//``\\ ：仅计算包含指定状态的矩阵元（例如 state=2.1,ms2=0 表示对称性 1"
" 中的第一激发单重态）。"

msgid ""
"``EXPEC2,$oper_1,oper_2,\\ldots,oper_n$\\\\`` "
"``TRAN2,[print_zero],$oper_1,oper_2,\\ldots,oper_n$``"
msgstr ""
"``EXPEC2,$oper_1,oper_2,\\ldots,oper_n$\\\\`` "
"``TRAN2,[print_zero],$oper_1,oper_2,\\ldots,oper_n$``"

msgid ""
"``Note that only matrix elements between states of the same symmetry can be "
"computed.``"
msgstr "``注意：只能计算相同对称性状态之间的矩阵元。``"

msgid ""
"will calculate expectation values and matrix elements of the mass "
"polarization operator :math:`P_e^2=-VELO^2` which is one of the non-"
"adiabatic correction terms. The corresponding variables are MPOL and TRMPOL."
msgstr ""
"将计算质量极化算符 :math:`P_e^2=-VELO^2` 的期望值和矩阵元，该算符是非绝热修正项之一。相应的变量为 MPOL 和 TRMPOL。"

msgid "``DM,[spindens]``"
msgstr "``DM,[spindens]``"

msgid ""
"``CPMCSCF,GRAD,state,[SPIN=spin],[MS2=ms2],[ACCU=thresh],[RECORD=record]``"
msgstr ""
"``CPMCSCF,GRAD,state,[SPIN=spin],[MS2=ms2],[ACCU=thresh],[RECORD=record]``"

msgid ""
"where *state* specifies the state (e.g., 2.1 for the second state in "
"symmetry 1) for which the gradients will computed. *spin* specifies the spin"
" of the state: this is half the value used in the corresponding WF card "
"(e.g., 0=Singlet, 0.5=Doublet, 1=Triplet). Alternatively, ``MS2`` can be "
"used, where *ms2* = 2\\*spin, i.e., the same as specified on ``WF`` cards. "
"The specification of ``SPIN`` or ``MS2`` is only necessary if states with "
"different spin are state-averaged. *record* specifies a record on which the "
"gradient information is stored (the default is 5101.1). *thresh* is a "
"threshold for the accuracy of the CP-MCSCF solution. The default is 1.d-7."
msgstr ""
"其中 *state* 指定要计算梯度的状态（例如，2.1 表示对称性 1 中的第二个状态）。\\ *spin* 指定该状态的自旋：这是相应 WF "
"卡中使用的值的一半（例如，0=单重态，0.5=双重态，1=三重态）。也可以使用 ``MS2``\\ ，其中 *ms2* = 2\\*spin，即与 "
"``WF`` 卡中指定的相同。仅当不同自旋的状态进行态平均时，才需要指定 ``SPIN`` 或 ``MS2``。*\\ record\\ * "
"指定存储梯度信息的记录（默认为 5101.1）。*\\ thresh* 是 CP-MCSCF 解的精度阈值。默认为 1.d-7。"

msgid "``CPMCSCF,DGRAD,state1,state2,[ACCU=thresh],[RECORD=record]``"
msgstr "``CPMCSCF,DGRAD,state1,state2,[ACCU=thresh],[RECORD=record]``"

msgid "``CPMCSCF,NACM,state1,state2,[ACCU=thresh],[RECORD=record]``"
msgstr "``CPMCSCF,NACM,state1,state2,[ACCU=thresh],[RECORD=record]``"

msgid "``CPMCSCF,HESS,[ACCU=value]``"
msgstr "``CPMCSCF,HESS,[ACCU=value]``"

msgid ""
"Using this keyword, the optimization of the CI coefficients is carried out "
"by *CASVB*. The ``VB`` keyword can be followed by any of the directives "
"described in section :doc:`the VB program CASVB <the_vb_program_casvb>`. "
"Energy-based optimization of the VB parameters is the default, and the "
"output level for the main *CASVB* iterations is reduced to :math:`-1`."
msgstr ""
"使用此关键字时，CI 系数的优化由 *CASVB* 执行。\\ ``VB`` 关键字后可以跟 :doc:`VB 程序 CASVB "
"<the_vb_program_casvb>` 一节中描述的任何指令。VB 参数的基于能量的优化是默认设置，主要 *CASVB* 迭代的输出级别降低为 "
":math:`-1`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"El Khatib, T. Leininger, G.L. Bendazzoli, and S. Evangelisti, `Chem. Phys. "
"Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2013.10.080>`__ **591**, 58 "
"(2014)."
msgstr ""
"El Khatib, T. Leininger, G.L. Bendazzoli, and S. Evangelisti, `Chem. Phys. "
"Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2013.10.080>`__ **591**, 58 "
"(2014)."

msgid ""
"O. Brea, M. El Khatib, C. Angeli, G.L. Bendazzoli, S. Evangelisti, and T. "
"Leininger, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct400453b>`__ **9**, 5286 (2013). All "
